hadiths[166]{hadithnumber,text}:
"6785","Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hijjatul-wada ke mauqe par farmaya ''haan tum log kis cheez ko sabse zyada hurmat wali samajhtey ho? '' logon ne kaha ke apne isi maheene ko. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''haan, kis Shahar ko tum sabse zyada hurmat wala samajhtey ho?'' logon ne jawab diya ke apne isi Shahar ko . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ''haan, kis din ko tum sabse zyada hurmat wala khayal kartey ho? '' logon ne kaha ke apne isi din ko . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ab farmaya '' phir bila shubah Allah ne tumharey khoon , tumharey maal aur tumhari izzaton ko hurmat wala qarar diya hai, siwa iske haq ke, jaisa ke is din ki hurmat is Shahar aur is maheene mein hai. haan ! kya maine tumhen pahuncha diyaa.'' teen martaba Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aur har martaba sahaba ne jawab diya ke ji haan , pahuncha diya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' afsos mere baad tum kaafir na bin jana ke aik doosrey ki gardan maarney lago.''"
"6786","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko jab bhi 2 chizon mein se aik ke ikhtiyar karne ka hukm diya gaya to aap ne unmein se aasan hi ko pasand kya, basharte ke usmein gunah ka koi pahlu na ho, agar usmein gunah ka koi pahlu hota to aap us se sabse zyada door hotey. Allah ki qism ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi apne zaatii maamle mein kisi se badla nahi liya, albatta jab Allah ki hurmaton ko todaa jata to aap Allah ke liye badla letey they."
"6787","Usama (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik aurat ki (jis par qurbani ka janwar muqaddima honey wala tha) sifarish ki to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum se pahley ke log isliye halaak ho gaey ke wo kamzoron par to had qaaim kartey aur buland martaba logon ko chhod detey they. us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai. agar Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne bhi) chori ( ki hoti to main uska bhi hath kaat leta ."
"6788","aik makhzumi aurat ka mamla jisne chori ki thi, Quraish ke logon ke liye ahmiyat ikhtiyar kar gaya aur unhon-ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se is maamle mein kon baat kar sakta hai Usama (Raziallahu anhu) ke siwaa, jo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bahut piyarey hain aur koi aap se sifarish ki himmat nahi kar sakta ? chunanche Usama (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baat ki to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''kya tum Allah ki hadon mein sifarish karne aaey ho.'' phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey aur khutba diya aur farmaya ''aey logo! tum se pahley ke log isliye gumrah ho gaey ke jab unmein koi bada aadmi chori karta to usey chhod detey lekin agar kamzor chori karta to is par had qaaim kartey they aur Allah ki qasam! agar Fatima binte-Muhammad ne bhi chori ki hoti to Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) iska hath zaroor kaat daaltey."
"6789","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''chauthaaii Dinar ya us se zyada par hath kaat liya jaaeyga.'' is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Abdur-Rehman bin Khalid Zohri ke bhatijey aur Mamar ne Zohri ke waaste se ki."
"6790","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' chor ka hath aik chothai Dinar par kaat liya jaaeyga.''"
"6791","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' chothai Dinar par hath kaataa jaaeyga.''"
"6792","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein chor ka hath baghair lakdi ke chamdey ki dhaal ya aam dhaal ki chori par hi kaataa jata tha. ham se Usman ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Humaid-bin-Abdur-Rehmaan ne bayan kya, unse Hisham ne bayan kya, unse unke walid ne, unse Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne isi tarah ( bayan kya ( ."
"6793","chor ka hath lakdi ke chamdey ki dhaal ya aam dhaal ki qeemat se kam par nahi kaataa jata tha. ye donon dhaal qeemat se miltii thin. uski riwayat Wakee aur ibne-Idrees ne Hisham ke waastey se ki, unse unke walid ne mursalan riwayat kya."
"6794","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein chor ka hath dhaal ki qeemat se kam par nahi kaataa jata tha. lakdi ke chamdey ki dhaal ho ya aam dhaal, ye donon cheezein qeemat wali thin."
"6795","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik dhaal par hath kaataa tha jiski qeemat teen dirham thi."
"6796","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik dhaal ki chori par hath kaataa tha jiski qeemat teen dirham thi."
"6797","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik dhaal par hath kaataa tha jiski qeemat teen dirham thi."
"6798","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik chor ka hath aik dhaal par kaataa tha jiski qeemat teen dirham thi, is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Muhammad-bin Ishaq ne ki aur Leis ne bayan kya ke mujh se Naafe ne ( ثمنه (ke bajaey) lafz ( قيمته ( kaha,"
"6799","maine Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala ne chor par laanat ki hai ke aik andaa churaataa hai aur iska hath kaataa jata hai, aik rassii churaataa hai aur uska hath kaataa jata hai."
"6800","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik aurat ka hath katwaayaa. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke wo aurat baad mein bhi aati thi aur main uski zarooratein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney rakhti thi, us aurat ne tauba kar li thi aur Hasan tauba ka saboot diya tha."
"6801","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik jamat ke sath bait ki thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke main tum se ahad leta hun ke tum Allah ka kisi ko Sharik nahi thahraaogey, tum chori nahi karogey, apni aulad ki jaan nahi logey , apne dil se ghad kar kisi par tohmat nahi lagaaogey aur nek kaamon mein meri nafarmani na karogey. to tum mein se jo koi waadey pura karega uska sawab Allah ke uper lazim hai aur jo koi unmein se kuchh ghalati kar guzrega aur duniya mein hi usey uski saza mil jaeygi to ye uska kaffara hogi aur usey paak karne wali hogi aur jiski ghalati ko Allah chipa lega to uska mamla Allah ke sath hai, chahey to usey azab de aur chahey to uski maghfirat kar de. abu-Adbullah imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke hath katney ke baad agar chor ne tauba kar li to uski gawahi qabool hogi. yahi haal har us shakhs ka hai jis par had jari ki gaee ho ke agar wo tauba kar lega to uski gawahi qabool ki jaeygi."
"6802","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas qabila ukul ke chand log aaey aur Islam qabool kya lekin Madina ki aab w hua unhein muwafiq nahi aai (unke pet phool gaey ( to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke sadqe ke oonton ke rewad mein jayen aur unka peshab aur doodh mila kar piein. unhon-ne iske mutabiq amal kya aur tandurust ho gaey lekin iske baad wo murtad ho gaey aur un oonton ke charwaahon ko qatl karke oont hankaa ley gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki talash mein sawar bhejey aur unhein pakad ke laya gaya phir unke hath paon kaat diye gaey aur unki aankhen phod di gain (kyonke unhon-ne Islami charwaahey ke sath aisa hi bartaw kya tha) aur unke zakhmon par dagh nahi lagwaayaa gaya yahan tak ke wo mar gaey."
"6803","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Urainiyon ke) hath paon ( katwaa diye lekin un par dagh nahi lagwaayaa , yahan tak ke wo mar gaey."
"6804","qabila ukul ke kuchh log Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas 6 hijri mein aaey aur ye log masjid ke saaybaan mein thahrey . Madina Munawra ki aab w hua unhein muwafiq nahi aai. unhon-ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! hamarey liye doodh kahin se muhaiya kara dein, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye to mere paas nahi hai. albatta tum log hamarey oonton mein chaley jao . chunanche wo aaey aur unka doodh aur peshab piyaa aur sihat mand ho kar motey taazey ho gaey. phir unhon-ne charwaahey ko qatl kar diya aur oonton ko hankaa ley gaey. itney main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas faryaadii pahuncha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki talash mein sawar bhejey. abhi dhoop zyada phailii bhi nahi thi ke unhein pakad kar laya gaya phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm se salaaiyaan garm ki gain aur unki aankhon mein pher di gain aur unke hath paon kaat diye gaey aur unke ( zakhm se khoon ko rokney ke liye) unhein daaghaa bhi nahi gaya. iske baad wo Harra (Madina ki pathreelii zameen ( mein daal diye gaey, wo pani maangtey they lekin unhein pani nahi diya gaya. yahan tak ke wo mar gaey. abu-Qilaba ne kaha ke ye is wjah se kya gaya tha ke unhon-ne chori ki thi, qatl kya tha aur Allah aur uske rasool se ghaddaaraana ladai ladii thi."
"6805","qabila ukul ya Uraina ke chand log main samajhta hun ukul ka lafz kaha, Madina aaey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke liye doodh dene wali oontniyon ka intizam kar diya aur farmaya ke wo oonton ke galle mein jayen aur unka peshab aur doodh piein. chunanche unhon-ne piyaa aur jab wo tandurust ho gaey to charwaahey ko qatl kar diya aur oonton ko hankaa ley gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas ye khabar subah ke waqt pahunchi to aap ne unke peechhey sawar daudaaey. abhi dhoop zyada phailii bhi nahi thi ke wo pakad kar laey gaey. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm se unke bhi hath paon kaat diye gaey aur unki bhi aankhon mein silai pher di gaee aur unhein Harra mein daal diya gaya. wo pani maangtey they lekin unhein pani nahi diya jata tha. abu-Qilaba ne kaha ke ye wo log they jinhoney chori ki thi, qatl kya tha, eman ke baad kufr ikhtiyar kya tha aur Allah aur uske rasool se ghaddaaraana ladai ladii thi."
"6806","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' saat (7) aadmi aisey hain jinhein Allah Taala qiyamat ke din apne arsh ke nichey saaya dega jabke uske arsh ke saaye ke siwa aur koi saaya nahi hoga. aadil haakim, naujawaan jisne Allah ki ibadat mein jawaanii paaii, aisa shakhs jisne Allah ko tanhai mein yad kya aur uski aankhon se aansu nikal padey, wo shakhs jiska dil masjid mein laga rehta hai, wo aadmi jo Allah ke liye mohabbat kartey hain, wo shakhs jisey kisi buland martaba aur khoobsurat aurat ne apni taraf bulaya aur us ne jawab diya ke main Allah se darta hun aur wo shakhs jisne itna posheeda sadqa kya ke uske baaein hath ko bhi pata na chal saka ke daain ne kitna aur kya sadqa kya hai.''"
"6807","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne mujhey apne donon paon ke darmyan yani ( sharmgah ( ki aur apne donon jabdon ke darmyan (yani zaban ( ki zamaanat de di to main usey jannat mein janey ka bharosa dilata hoon.''"
"6808","main tum se aik aisi hadis bayan karunga ke mere baad koi usey nahi bayan karega. maine ye hadis Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suni hai. maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye kehtey suna ke qiyamat us waqt tak qaaim nahi hogi ya yun farmaya ke qiyamat ki nishaniyon mein se ye hai ke ilm Deen duniya se uth jaeyga aur jahaalat phail jaeygi, sharab kasrat se pi janey lagegii aur zina phail jaeyga mard kam ho jaeinge aur aurton ki kasarat hogi. haalat yahan tak pahunch jaeygi ke pachaas aurton par aik hi khabar leney wala mard reh jaeyga"
"6809","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''banda jab zina karta hai to wo momin nahi rehta . banda jab chori karta hai to wo momin nahi rehta aur banda jab sharab peetaa hai to wo momin nahi rehta aur jab wo qatl nahaq karta hai to wo momin nahi rahtaa. Ikrima ne kaha ke maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha ke eman us se kis tarah nikal liya jata hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo is tarah aur us waqt aap ne apni ungliyon ko doosrey hath ki ungliyon mein daal kar phir alag kar liya phir agar wo tauba kar leta hai to eman uske paas lot aata hai, is tarah aur aap ne apni ungliyon ko doosrey hath ki ungliyon mein dala."
"6810","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''zinaa karne wala jab zina karta hai to wo momin nahi rehta, wo chor jab chori karta hai to wo momin nahi rehta, shraabii jab sharab peetaa hai to wo momin nahi rehta . phir un sab aadmiyon ke liye tauba ka darwaza bahar-haal khula hua hai.''"
"6811","maine puchha : ya Rasulullah ! kon sa gunah sabse bada hai. farmaya ye ke tum Allah ka kisi ko Sharik banaao, halanke usi ne tumhen paida kya hai. maine puchha : iske ba'd? farmaya ye ke tum apni aulad ko us  khatrey (خطرے) se mar dalo ke wo tumharey khaney main tumharey sath Sharik hogi. maine puchha : iske ba'd? farmaya ye ke tum apne padosi ki biwi se zina karo, Yahya ne bayan kya, unse Sufiyan ne bayan kya, unse vaasiil (واصل) ne bayan kya, unse abu-Waeil ne aur unse Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! phir usi hadis ki tarah bayan kya. Amr ne kaha ke phir maine is hadis ka zikr Abdur-Rehman-bin-Mehdi se kya aur unhon-ne ham se ye hadis Sufiyan soury se bayan ki, unse Aa'mash, Mansoor aur vaasiil (واصل) ne, unseunse abu-Waeil (ابوائل) ne aur unse abu-maisraa (ابومیسرہ) ne. Abdur-Rehman-bin-Mehdi ne kaha ke tum is sanad ko janey bhi do."
"6812","jab unhon-ne Juma ke din aurat ko rajm (sangsaar) kya to kaha ke maine iska rajm (sangsaar) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sunnat ke mutabiq kya hai."
"6813","kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kisi ko rajm (sangsaar) kya tha? unhon-ne kaha ke haan, maine puchha : sura Noor se pahley ya iske ba'd? kaha ke ye mujhey malum nahi (naa-maaloom baat ke liye laa-ilmii zahir kar dena kar dena bhi durust hai)."
"6814","qabila Aslam ke aik sahib Maaiz naam ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaey aur kaha ke maine zina kya hai. phir unhon-ne apne zina ka char martaba iqrar kya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke rajm (sangsaar) ka hukm diya aur unhein rajm (sangsaar) kya gaya, wo shadi shuda they."
"6815","aik sahib Maaiz bin Malik Aslami Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaey, us waqt Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjid mein they, unhon-ne aapko awaz di aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! maine zina kar liya hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki taraf se munh pher liya. unhon-ne ye baat char baar dohraaii jab char baar unhon-ne us gunah ki apne uper shahadat di to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein bulaya aur malum farmaya kya tum deewaaney ho? unhon-ne kaha ke nahi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke phir kya tum shadi shuda ho? unhon-ne kaha ji haan. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unhein ley jao aur rajm (sangsaar) kar do."
"6816","rajm (sangsaar) karne walon mein, main bhi tha ham ne unhein aabadi se bahar eidgaah ke paas rajm (sangsaar) kya tha jab un par patthar padey to wo bhag padey lekin ham ne unhein Harra ke paas pakda aur rajm (sangsaar) kar diya."
"6817","Sad-bin-abi-Waqas aur abd-bin-Zam'a (Raziallahu anhu) ne aapas mein (eik bachchey Abdur-Rehman naam ke mein) ikhtilaf kya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''abd-bin-Zam'a ! bachcha to ley-ley bachcha usi ko milega jiski jouroo ya londi ke pet se wo paida hua aur Sauda ! tum us se parda kya karo.'' imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke Quteba ne Leis se is zyada ke sath bayan kya ke zaanii ke hissey mein patthar ki saza hai."
"6818","maine Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''ladkaa usi ko milta hai jiski jouroo ya londi ke pet se hua ho aur haram kaar ke liye sirf patthar hain.''"
"6819","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik Yahudi mard aur aik Yahudi aurat ko laya gaya, jinhoney zina kya tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse puchha ke tumhari kitab Taurait mein uski saza kya hai? unhon-ne kaha ke hamarey ulma ne (uskii sazaa) chehrey ko siyah karna aur gadhey par ulta sawar karna tajwiz ki hui hai. is par Abdullaah-bin-Salaam (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! unse Taurait mangwaaiye. jab Taurait laai gaee to unmein se aik ne rajm (sangsaar) wali aayat par apna hath rakh liya aur us se aagey aur peechhey ki aayatein padhney laga. Abdullaah-bin-Salaam (Raziallahu anhu) ne us se kaha ke apna hath hataao (aur jab us ne apna hath hataya to) aayat rajm (sangsaar) uske hath ke nichey thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un donon ke mutaalliq hukm diya aur unhein rajm (sangsaar) kar diya gaya. ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke unhein balaat (masjide-Nabawi ke qareeb aik jagah ( mein rajm (sangsaar) kya gaya. maine dekha ke Yahudi aurat ko mard bachaney ke liye is par jhuk-jhuk padta tha."
"6820","qabila Aslam ke aik sahib (maaiz bin Maalik) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey aur zina ka iqrar kya. lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki taraf se apna munh pher liya. phir jab unhon-ne char martaba apne liye gawahi di to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse puchha kya tum deewaaney ho gaey ho? unhon-ne kaha ke nahi. phir aap ne puchha kya tumhara nikah ho chuka hai? unhon-ne kaha ke haan. chunanche aap ke hukm se unhein eidgaah mein rajm (sangsaar) kya gaya. jab un par patthar padey to wo bhag padey lekin unhein pakad liya gaya aur rajm (sangsaar) kya gaya yahan tak ke wo mar gaey. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke haq mein kalima khair farmaya aur unka janaaza ada kya aur unki tareef ki jiske wo mustahiq they."
"6821","aik sahib ne Ramazan main apni biwi se ham-bistarii kar li aur phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iska hukm puchha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya tumharey paas koi ghulam hai? unhon-ne kaha ke nahi. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya do mahiney rozey rakhney ki tum mein taqat nahi ? unhon-ne kaha ke nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par kaha ke phir sath (60) mohtajon ko khana khilaao ."
"6822","aik sahib Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas masjid mein aaey aur arz kya main to dozakh ka mustahiq ho gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha kya baat huii? kaha ke maine apni biwi se Ramazan mein hambistari kar li hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse kaha ke phir sadqa kar. unhon-ne kaha ke mere paas kuchh bhi nahi. phir wo baith gaya aur uske baad aik sahib gadhaa haanktey laey jis par khaney ki cheez rakhi thi. Abdur-Rehman ne bayan kya ke mujhey malum nahi ke wo kya cheez thi. (doosri riwayat mein yun hai ke khajoor ladi hui thi) usey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas laya ja raha tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha ke aag mein jalney waley sahib kahan hain? wo sahib boley ke main hazir hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey ley aur sadqa kar de. unhon-ne puchha kya apne se zyada mohtaaj ko dun? mere ghar walon ke liye to khud koi khaney ki cheez nahi hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir tum hi kha lo. Abdullah imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke pehlii hadis zyada waazeh hai jis main (أطعم أهلك) ke alfaz hain."
"6823","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas tha ke aik sahib Ka'b-bin-Amr aaey aur kaha : ya Rasulullah! mujh par had (sharaii sazaa) wajib ho gaee hai. aap mujh par had jari keejiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se kuchh nahi poochha. bayan kya ke phir Namaz ka waqt ho gaya aur un sahib ne bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Namaz padhi. jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz padh chukey to wo phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aa kar khadey ho gaey aur kaha : ya Rasulullah ! mujh par had wajib ho gaee hai aap kitabullah ke hukm ke mutabiq mujh par had jari kijiye . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke kya tum ne abhi hamarey sath Namaz nahi padhi hai. unhon-ne kaha ke ji . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir Allah ne tera gunah maaf kar diya ya farmaya ke teri ghalati ya had (muaaf kar dii)."
"6824","jab Maaiz bin Malik Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke ghaaliban tu ney bosa diya hoga ya ishara kya hoga ya dekha hoga. unhon-ne kaha ke nahi ya Rasulullah ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya kya phir tu ney ham-bistarii hi kar li hai? is martaba aap ne ishaaroo se kaam nahi liya. bayan kya ke iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein rajm (sangsaar) ka hukm diya."
"6825","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik sahib aaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt masjid mein baithey huey they. unhon-ne awaz di ya Rasulullah ! maine zina kya hai. khud apne mutaalliq wo keh rahe they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse apna munh pher liya. lekin wo sahib bhi hat kar usi taraf khadey ho gaey jidhar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna munh phera tha aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! maine zina kya hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir apna munh pher liya aur wo bhi dobara us taraf aagey jidhar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna munh phera tha aur is tarah jab us ne char martaba apne gunah ka iqrar kar liya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usko bulaya aur puchha kya tum paagal (پاگل) ho? unhon-ne kaha ke nahi ya Rasulullah ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha kya tum shadi shuda ho? unhon-ne kaha : ji ya Rasulullah ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sahaba se farmaya ke unhein ley jao aur rajm (sangsaar) kar do."
"6826","main bhi un logon mein shamil tha jinhoney unhein rajm (sangsaar) kya tha jab un par patthar padey to wo bhaagney lagey. lekin ham ne unhein Harra (Harra Madina ki pathreelii zameen) mein ja liya aur unhein rajm (sangsaar) kar diya."
"6827","main bhi un logon mein shamil tha jinhoney unhein rajm (sangsaar) kya tha jab un par patthar padey to wo bhaagney lagey. lekin ham ne unhein Harra (Harra Madina ki pathreelii zameen) mein ja liya aur unhein rajm (sangsaar) kar diya."
"6828","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas they, to aik sahib khadey huey aur kaha, main aapko Allah ki qism deta hun aap hamarey darmyan Allah ki kitab se faisla karein. is par uska muqabil bhi khada ho gaya aur wo pahley se zyada samajhdaar tha, phir usne kaha ke waqei aap hamarey darmyan kitabullah se hi faisla kijiye aur mujhey bhi guftgu ki ijazat dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kaho, us shakhs ne kaha ke mera betaa us shakhs ke yahan mazdoorii par kaam karta tha phir us ne uski aurat se zina kar liya, maine iske fidya mein usey sou (100) bakri aur aik khaadim diya, phir maine kuchh ilm walon se puchha to unhon-ne mujhey bataya ke mere ladkey par so kode aur aik saal Shahar Badr honey ki had wajib hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai main tumharey darmyan kitabullah hi ke mutabiq faisla karunga . sou (100) bakriyaan aur khaadim tumhen wapas hongey aur tumharey betey ko so kode lagaey jaeinge aur aik saal ke liye usey shahar badar kya jaeyga aur aey unnais ! subah ko uski aurat ke paas jana agar wo (zinaa ka ( iqrar kar ley to usey rajm (sangsaar) kar do. chunanche wo subah ko uske paas gaey aur us ne iqrar kar liya aur unhon-ne rajm (sangsaar) kar diya. Ali-bin-Abdullaah-madeenii kehtey hain maine Sufiyaan-bin-Ueina se puchha jis shakhs ka betaa tha us ne yun nahi kaha ke un aalimon ne mujh se bayan kya ke terey betey par rajm (sangsaar) hai. unhon-ne kaha ke mujh ko usmein shak hai ke Zohri se maine suna hai ya nahi, isliye maine usko kabhi bayan kya, kabhi nahi bayan kya, balkii khaamoosh raha."
"6829","umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, main darta hun ke kahin zyada waqt guzar jaey aur koi shakhs ye kehney lagey ke kitabullah main to rajm (sangsaar) ka hukm hamein kahin nahi milta aur is tarah wo Allah ke aik fareeza ko chhod kar gumrah hon jisey Allah Taala ne nazil kya hai. aagah ho jao ke rajm (sangsaar) ka hukm us shakhs ke liye farz hai jisne shadi shuda honey ke bawajud zina kya ho basharte ke sahi sharaee gawaahiyon se Sabit ho jaey ya hamal ho ya koi khud iqrar kare. Sufiyan ne bayan kya ke maine isi tarah yad kya tha aagah ho jao ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne rajm (sangsaar) kya tha aur aap ke baad ham ne rajm (sangsaar) kya tha."
"6830","mein kai muhajireen ko) Quran Majeed ( padhaayaa karta tha. Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu) bhi unmein se aik they. abhi main Mina mein unke makan par tha aur wo umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke aakhiri Haj main (23 hijri ( unke sath they ke wo mere paas lot kar aaey aur kaha ke kash! tum us shakhs ko dekhtey jo aaj ameerul-momineen ke paas aaya tha. usne kaha ke aey ameerul-momineen! kya aap falan sahib se ye poochh-gachh karengey jo ye kehtey hain ke agar umr ka intiqal ho gaya to main falan sahib Talha bin Ubaidullah se bait karunga kyonke Allah ki qism Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki baghair sochey samjhey bait to achcha ho gaee aur phir wo mukammal ho gaee thi. is par umr (Raziallahu anhu) bahut ghussa huey aur kaha, main inshaAllah Sham ke waqt logon se khitab karunga aur unhein un logon se daraaoonga jo zabardastii se dakhal dr-ma'qoolaat karna chahtey hain. Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke is par maine arz kya : ya ameerul-momineen! aisa na kijiye . Haj ke mausam mein kam samjhii aur burey-bhaley har hi qism ke log jama hain aur jab aap khitab ke liye khadey hongey to aap ke qareeb yahi log zyada hongey aur mujhey dar hai ke aap khadey ho kar koi baat kahein aur wo charon taraf phail jaey, lekin phailaaney waley usey sahi taur par yad na rakh sakengey aur uske ghalat maana pehnaaney lagengey, isliye Madina Munawra pahunchne tak ka intizar kar lijiye kyonke wo hijrat aur sunnat ka maqam hai. wahan aapko khalis deeni samajh-boojh rakhney waley aur sharif log milengey, wahan aap jo kuchh kehna chahtey hain aitimad ke sath hi farma sakengey aur ilm waley aap ki baton ko yad bhi rakhengey aur jo sahi matlab hai wahi bayan karengey. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha haan achchha Allah ki qism main Madina Munawra pahunchtey hi sabse pahley logon ko usi mazmoon ka khutba doonga . Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir ham Zil-Hijja ke maheene ke aakhir mein Madina Munawra pahunchey . Juma ke din suraj dhaltey hi ham ne (masjide-Nabawii) pahunchne mein jaldi ki aur maine dekha ke Saeed bin Zaid-bin-Amr-bin-Nufail mimber ki jad ke paas baithey huey they. main bhi unke paas baith gaya. mera takhna unke takhney se laga hua tha. thodi hi der mein umr (Raziallahu anhu) bhi bahar nikley, jab maine unhein aatey dekha to Saeed bin Zaid-bin-Amr-bin-Nufail (Raziallahu anhu) se maine kaha ke aaj umr (Raziallahu anhu) aisi baat kahengey jo unhon-ne us se pahley khaleefa banaey janey ke baad kabhi nahi kahi thi. lekin unhon-ne usko na maanaa aur kaha ke main to nahi samajhta ke aap koi aisi baat kahengey jo pahley kabhi nahi kahi thi. phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) member par baithey aur jab muazzan azan de kar khamosh hua to aap khadey huey aur Allah Taala ki sana uski shaan ke mutabiq bayan karne ke baad farmaya : ammaa ba'd! aaj main tum se aik aisi baat kahunga jiska kehna meri taqdeer mein likha hua tha, mujh ko nahi malum ke shayad meri ye guftgu maut ke qareeb ki aakhiri guftgu ho. to jo koi usey samjhey aur mehfooz rakhey usey chahiye ke is baat ko us jagah tak pahuncha de jahan tak uski sawari usey ley ja sakti hai aur jisey khof ho ke usne baat nahi samjhii hai to uske liye jaaiz nahi hai ke meri taraf ghalat baat mansub kare. bila shubah Allah Taala ne Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko haq ke sath maboos kya aur aap par kitab nazil ki, kitabullah ki sura mein jo kuchh aap par nazil hua, unmein aayat rajm (sangsaar) bhi thi. ham ne usey padha tha samjha tha aur yad rakha tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khud (apne zamane mein) rajm (sangsaar) karaya. phir aap ke baad ham ne bhi rajm (sangsaar) kya lekin mujhey dar hai ke agar waqt yun hi aagey badhtaa raha to kahin koi ye na dawa kar baithey ke rajm (sangsaar) ki aayat ham kitabullah mein nahi patey aur is tarah wo us fareeze ko chhod kar gumrah hon jisey Allah Taala ne nazil kya tha. yaqinan rajm (sangsaar) ka hukm kitabullah se us shakhs ke liye Sabit hai jisne shadi honey ke baad zina kya ho. chahe mard hon ya auratein , basharte ke gawahi mukammal ho jaey ya hamal zahir ho ya wo khud iqrar kar ley phir kitabullah ki aayaton mein ham ye bhi padhtey they ke apne haqiqi bap daadon ke siwa dusron ki taraf apne aapko mansub na karo. kyonke ye tumhara kufr aur inkar hai ke tum apne asl bap daadon ke siwa dusron ki taraf apni nisbat karo. haan aur sun lo ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye bhi farmaya tha ke meri tareef had se badha kar na karna jis tarah Esa ibne-Maryam (Alaihissalam) ki had se badha kar ta'reefein ki gain (unko Allah ko betaa bana diya gaya) balke ( mere liye sirf ye kaho ke) mein Allah ka banda aur uska rasool hun aur mujhey ye bhi malum hua hai ke tum mein se kisi ne yun kaha hai ke Allah ki qism agar umr ka intiqal ho gaya to main falan se bait karunga dekho tum mein se kisi ko ye dhokaa na ho ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki bait naagaah hui aur Allah ne naa-gahaanii bait mein jo burai hui hai us se tum ko bachaaey rakha uski wjah ye hui ke tum ko Allah Taala ne uske shar se mehfooz rakha aur tum mein koi shakhs aisa nahi jo Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) jaisa muttaqii , khuda taras ho. tum mein kon hai jis se milney ke liye oont chillaey jatey hun. dekho khayal rakho koi shakhs kisi se baghair musalmanon ke salaah-mashware aur ittifaq aur ghalba raayon ke baghair bait na karey jo koi aisa karega uska nateeja yahi hoga ke bait karne wala aur bait leney wala donon apni jaan ganwaa dengey aur sun lo bila shubah jis waqt Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat hui to Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ham sabse behtar they albatta Ansar ne hamari mukhalifat ki thi aur wo sab log Saqeefaa-banii-saaida mein jama ho gaey they. isi tarah Ali aur Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) aur unke sathiyon ne bhi hamari mukhalifat ki thi aur baqi muhajireen Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas jama ho gaey they. us waqt maine Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha : aey Abu-Bakar ! hamein apne un Ansari bhaiyon ke paas ley chaliye . chunanche ham unse mulaqat ke irade se chal padey . jab ham unke qareeb pahunchey to hamari , unhein ke 2 nek logon se mulaqat hui aur unhon-ne ham se bayan kya ke Ansari aadmiyon ne ye baat thahraaii hai ke) Sad-bin-Ubada ko khaleefa banaaein) aur unhon-ne poochha. hazraat muhajireen aap log kahan ja rahe hain. ham ne kaha ke ham apne un Ansari bhaiyon ke paas ja rahe hain. unhon-ne kaha ke aap log hargiz wahan na jayen balke khud jo karna hai kar dalo lekin maine kaha ke b-khudaa ham zaroor jaengey. chunanche ham aagey badhey aur Ansar ke paas Saqeefaa-banii-saaida mein pahunchey majlis mein aik sahib (sardaar khazraj) chadar apne sarey jism par lapetey darmyan mein baithey they. maine puchha ke ye kon sahib hain to logon ne bataya ke Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) hain. maine puchha ke unhein kya ho gaya hai? logon ne bataya ke bukhar aa raha hai. phir hamarey thodi der tak baithney ke baad unke khateeb ne kalima shahadat padha aur Allah Taala ki uski shaan ke mutabiq tareef ki. phir kaha : ammaa ba'd! ham Allah ke Deen ke madadgaar ( Ansar (aur Islam ke lashkar hain aur tum aey giroh muhajireen ! kam tadaad mein ho. tumhari ye thodi si tadaad apni qaum Quraish se nikal kar ham logon mein aa rahe ho. tum log ye chahtey ho ke hamein jad se ukhaad dalo aur ham ko khilafat se mahroom karke aap khaleefa bin baitho, ye kabhi nahi ho sakta. jab wo khutba pura kar chukey to maine bolnaa chaha. maine aik umda taqreer apne zahan mein tarteeb de rakhi thi. meri badi khahish thi ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke baat karne se pahley hi main usko shuru kar dun aur Ansar ki taqreer se jo Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ko ghussa paida hua hai usko door kar dun jab maine baat karni chahi to Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha zara thehro maine unko naraz karna bura jaanaa. aakhir unhon-ne hi taqreer shuru ki aur Allah ki qism ! wo mujh se zyada aqlmand aur mujh se zyada sanjeeda aur mateen they. maine jo taqreer apne dil mein soch li thi usmein se unhon-ne koi baat nahi chhodii. faurii taur par wahi kahi balke us se bhi behtar phir wo khamosh ho gaey Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki taqreer ka khulaasa ye tha ke Ansari bhaiyo ! tum ne jo apni fazeelat aur buzurgi bayan ki hai wo sab durust hai aur tum beshak uske haqdaar ho magar khilafat Quraish ke siwa aur kisi khandan walon ke liye nahi ho sakti . kyonke Quraish azrooye nasb aur azrooye khandan tamam Arab qaumon mein badh chadh kar hain ab tum log aisa karo ke un 2 aadmiyon mein se kisi se bait kar lo Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne mera aur abu-Ubaida bin-Jarraah ka hath thaamaa wo hamarey beech mein baithey huey they, is saari guftgu mein sirf yahi aik baat mujh se mere siwa hui. Allah ki qism main aagey kar diya jata aur be-gunaah meri gardan mar di jati to ye mujhey us se zyada pasand tha ke mujhey aik aisi qaum ka ameer banaya jata jis mein Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) khud maujood hon. mera ab tak yahi khayal hai ye aur baat hai ke waqt par nafs mujhey bahkaa de aur main koi doosra khayal karun jo ab nahi karna. phir Ansar mein se aik kehney wala hubaab bin munzir yun kehney laga suno-suno main aik lakdi hun ke jis se oont apna badan ragad kar khujlii ki takleef rafa' kartey hain aur main wo baadh hun jo darakhton ke ird-gird hifazat ke liye lagai jati hai. main aik umda tadbeer bataataa hun aisa karo 2 khaleefa rahen (donon mil kar kaam karein) aik hamari qaum ka aur aik Quraish walon kaa. muhajireen qaum ka ab khub shor-ghul honey laga koi kuchh kehta koi kuchh kehta . main dar gaya ke kahin musalmanon mein phoot na pad jaey aakhir main keh utha abu-Bakar! apna hath badhaao, unhon-ne hath badhaya maine unse bait ki aur muhajireen jitney wahan maujood they unhon-ne bhi bait kar li phir ansaariyon ne bhi bait kar li (chalo jhagdaa tamam hua jo manzoor ilahi tha wahi zahir hua) iske baad ham Sad-bin-Ubada ki taraf badhey ( unhon-ne bait nahi ki) aik shakhs Ansar mein se kehney laga : bhaiyo ! bechaarey Sad-bin-Ubada ka tum ne khoon kar dala. maine kaha Allah uska khoon karega . umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne us khutbey mein ye bhi farmaya us waqt ham ko Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki khilafat se zyada koi cheez zaroori malum nahi hoti kyonke ham ko dar paida hua kahin aisa na ho ham logon se juda rahen aur abhi unhon-ne kisi se bait na ki ho wo kisi aur shakhs se bait kar baithein tab 2 Suraton se khali nahi hota ya to ham bhi jabran usi se bait kar letey ya logon ki mukhalifat kartey to aapas mein fasaad paida hota ( phoot pad jati ( dekho phir yahi kehta hun jo shakhs kisi se bin sochey samjhey , bin salaah w mashwara bait kar ley to doosrey log bait karne waley ki pairwi na karey, na uski jis se bait ki gaee hai kyonke wo donon apni jaan ginwaaeingey."
"6831","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un logon ke barey mein hukm de rahe they jo ghair shadi shuda hon aur zina kya ho ke so kode maarey jayen aur saal bhar ke liye jilaa watan kar diya jaey."
"6832","umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne jilaa watan kya tha phir yahi tariqa qaaim ho gaya."
"6833","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aisey shakhs ke barey mein jisne zina kya tha aur wo ghair shadi shuda tha, had qaaim karne ke sath aik saal tak Shahar se bahar karne ka faisla kya tha."
"6834","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un mardon par laanat ki hai jo mukhannas bantey hain aur un aurton par laanat ki hai jo mard bantii hain aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unhein apne gharon se nikal do aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne falan ko ghar se nikala tha aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne falan ko nikala tha."
"6835","aik dehati Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baithey huey they. unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! hamarey darmyan kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla kar dein. is par doosrey ne khadey ho kar kaha ke unhon-ne sahi kaha ya Rasulullah ! unka kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla karein, mera ladka unke yahan mazdoor tha aur phir us ne unki biwi ke sath zina kar liya. logon ne mujhey bataya ke mere ladkey ko rajm (sangsaar) kya jaeyga chunanche maine so bakriyon aur aik kaneez ka fidya diya. phir maine ahale-ilm se puchha to unka khayal hai ke mere ladkey par so kode aur aik saal ki jilaa watanii lazimi hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai main tum donon ka faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq karunga. bakriyan aur kaneez tumhen wapas milengii aur tumharey ladkey ko so kode aur aik saal ki jilaa watanii ki saza milegii aur Anees ! subah us aurat ke paas jao (aur agar wo iqrar karey to) usey rajm (sangsaar) kar do. chunanche unhon-ne usey rajm (sangsaar) kya. (wo aurat kahin aur jagah thi) aap ne usey rajm (sangsaar) karne ke liye Anees ko bheja usi se baab ka matlab nikla . qastalaanii ne kaha ke aap ne jo Anees ko fareeq saanii ki joru ke paas bheja wo zina ki had maarney ke liye nahi bheja kyonke zina ki had lagaaney ke liye tajassus karna ya dhoondhnaa bhi durust nahi hai agar koi khud aa kar bhi zina ka iqrar karey uske liye bhi chhaanbeen karna mustahab hai, yani yun kehna ke shayad tu ney bosa diya hoga ya chhuaa hoga balke aap ne Anees ko sirf isliye bheja ke us aurat ko khabar kar dein ke falan shakhs ne tujh par zina ki tohmat lagai hai. ab wo hade-qazaf ka mutalba karti hai ya maaf karti hai. jab Anees uske paas pahunchey to us aurat ne saaf taur par zina qabool kya. is qabool karney par Anees (Raziallahu anhu) ne usko had lagai aur rajm (sangsaar) kya."
"6836","eik dehati Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baithey huey they. unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! hamarey darmyan kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla kar dein. is par doosrey ne khadey ho kar kaha ke unhon-ne sahi kaha ya Rasulullah ! unka kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla karein, mera ladka unke yahan mazdoor tha aur phir us ne unki biwi ke sath zina kar liya. logon ne mujhey bataya ke mere ladkey ko rajm (sangsaar) kya jaeyga chunanche maine so bakriyon aur aik kaneez ka fidya diya. phir maine ahale-ilm se puchha to unka khayal hai ke mere ladkey par so kode aur aik saal ki jilaa watanii lazimi hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai main tum donon ka faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq karunga. bakriyan aur kaneez tumhen wapas milengii aur tumharey ladkey ko so kode aur aik saal ki jilaa watanii ki saza milegii aur Anees ! subah us aurat ke paas jao (aur agar wo iqrar karey to) usey rajm (sangsaar) kar do. chunanche unhon-ne usey rajm (sangsaar) kya. (wo aurat kahin aur jagah thi) aap ne usey rajm (sangsaar) karne ke liye Anees ko bheja usi se baab ka matlab nikla . qastalaanii ne kaha ke aap ne jo Anees ko fareeq saanii ki joru ke paas bheja wo zina ki had maarney ke liye nahi bheja kyonke zina ki had lagaaney ke liye tajassus karna ya dhoondhnaa bhi durust nahi hai agar koi khud aa kar bhi zina ka iqrar karey uske liye bhi chhaanbeen karna mustahab hai, yani yun kehna ke shayad tu ney bosa diya hoga ya chhuaa hoga balke aap ne Anees ko sirf isliye bheja ke us aurat ko khabar kar dein ke falan shakhs ne tujh par zina ki tohmat lagai hai. ab wo hade-qazaf ka mutalba karti hai ya maaf karti hai. jab Anees uske paas pahunchey to us aurat ne saaf taur par zina qabool kya. is qabool karney par Anees (Raziallahu anhu) ne usko had lagai aur rajm (sangsaar) kya."
"6837","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se us kaneez ke mutaalliq puchha gaya jo ghair shadi shuda ho aur zina kara liya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar wo zina kiraaey to usey kode maaro, agar phir zina kiraaey to phir kode maaro, agar phir zina kiraaey to phir kode maaro aur usey bech dalo chahe aik rassii hi qeemat mein miley. ibne-Shahab ne bayan kya ke mujhey yaqin nahi ke teesri martaba (kode lagaaney ke hukm (ke baad ye farmaya ya chothi martaba ke baad ."
"6838","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se us kaneez ke mutaalliq puchha gaya jo ghair shadi shuda ho aur zina kara liya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar wo zina kiraaey to usey kode maaro , agar phir zina kiraaey to phir kode maaro, agar phir zina kiraaey to phir kode maaro aur usey bech dalo chahe aik rassii hi qeemat mein miley. ibne-Shahab ne bayan kya ke mujhey yaqin nahi ke teesri martaba ( kode lagaaney ke hukm (ke baad ye farmaya ya chothi martaba ke baad ."
"6839","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar kaneez zina kiraaey aur uska zina khul jaey to usey kode maarney chaahiyein lekin laanat malaamat na karni chahiye phir agar wo dobara zina karey to phir chahiye ke kode maarey lekin malaamat na karey phir agar teesri martaba zina kiraaey to bech de chahe baalon ki aik rassii hi qeemat par ho. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Ismail bin Umayya ne Saeed se ki, unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne."
"6840","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne rajm (sangsaar) kya tha, maine puchha sura Noor se pahley ya iske ba'd, unhon-ne batlaya ke mujhey malum nahi. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Ali-bin-mus'hir, Khalid-bin-Abdullaah al-mahaarabi aur Ubaida-bin-Humaid ne Shebani se ki hai aur kuchh ne (sura Noor ke bajaey) sura Mayeda ka zikr kya hai lekin pehli riwayat sahi hai."
"6841","Yahudi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey aur kaha ke unmein se aik mard aur aik aurat ne zinaakaarii ki hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse puchha ke Taurait mein rajm (sangsaar) ke mutaalliq kya hukm hai? unhon-ne kaha ke ham unhein ruswa kartey hain aur kode lagaatey hain. Abdullaah-bin-Salaam (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par kaha ke tum jhootey ho usmein rajm (sangsaar) ka hukm maujood hai. chunanche wo Taurait laey aur khola . lekin unke aik shakhs ne apna hath aayate-rajm (sangsaar) par rakh diya aur us se pahley aur baad ka hissa padh diya. Abdullaah-bin-Salaam (Raziallahu anhu) ne us se kaha ke apna hath uthaao. us ne apna hath uthaya to iske nichey rajm (sangsaar) ki aayat maujood thi. phir unhon-ne kaha : aey Muhammad! aap ne sach farmaya ke usmein rajm (sangsaar) ki aayat maujood hai. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hukm diya aur donon rajm (sangsaar) kiye gaey. maine dekha ke mard aurat ko pattharon se bachaney ki koshish main is par jhukaa raha tha."
"6842","2 aadmi apna muqaddima Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas laey aur unmein se aik ne kaha ke hamara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq kar dijiye aur doosrey ne jo zyada samajhdaar they kaha ke ji haan ya Rasulullah! hamara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq kar dijiye aur mujhey arz karne ki ijazat dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kaho, unhon-ne kaha ke mera betaa un sahib ke yahan mazdoor tha. Malik ne bayan kya ke) Aseef ( mazdoor ko kehtey hain aur us ne unki biwi ke sath zina kar liya. logon ne mujh se kaha ke mere betey ki saza rajm (sangsaar) hai. chunanche maine iske fidye mein so bakriyan aur aik londi de di phir jab maine ilm walon se puchha to unhon-ne bataya ke mere ladkey ki saza so kode aur aik saal ke liye mulk badr karna hai. rajm (sangsaar) to sirf us aurat ko kya jaeyga isliye ke wo shadi shuda hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai. tumhara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq karunga. tumhari bakriyan aur tumhari londi tumhen wapas hain phir unke betey ko so kode lagwaaey aur aik saal ke liye Shahar badr kya aur Anees Aslami (Raziallahu anhu) ko hukm farmaya ke us mazkura (uper zikr) aurat ke paas jayen agar wo iqrar kar ley to usey rajm (sangsaar) kar dein chunanche us ne iqrar kya aur wo rajm (sangsaar) kar di gaee."
"6843","2 aadmi apna muqaddima Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas laey aur unmein se aik ne kaha ke hamara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq kar dijiye aur doosrey ne jo zyada samajhdaar they kaha ke ji haan ya Rasulullah! hamara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq kar dijiye aur mujhey arz karne ki ijazat dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kaho, unhon-ne kaha ke mera betaa un sahib ke yahan mazdoor tha. Malik ne bayan kya ke) Aseef ( mazdoor ko kehtey hain aur us ne unki biwi ke sath zina kar liya. logon ne mujh se kaha ke mere betey ki saza rajm (sangsaar) hai. chunanche maine iske fidye mein so bakriyan aur aik londi de di phir jab maine ilm walon se puchha to unhon-ne bataya ke mere ladkey ki saza so kode aur aik saal ke liye mulk badr karna hai. rajm (sangsaar) to sirf us aurat ko kya jaeyga isliye ke wo shadi shuda hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai. tumhara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq karunga. tumhari bakriyan aur tumhari londi tumhen wapas hain phir unke betey ko so kode lagwaaey aur aik saal ke liye Shahar badr kya aur Anees Aslami (Raziallahu anhu) ko hukm farmaya ke us mazkura (uper zikr) aurat ke paas jayen agar wo iqrar kar ley to usey rajm (sangsaar) kar dein chunanche us ne iqrar kya aur wo rajm (sangsaar) kar di gaii."
"6844","Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha tumhari wjah se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur sab logon ko rukna padaa jabke yahan pani bhi nahi hai. chunanche wo mujh par sakht naraz huey aur apne hath se meri kokh mein mukkaa maarney lagey magar maine apne jism mein kisi qism ki harkat isliye nahi honey di ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aaraam farma rahe they. phir Allah Taala ne tayammum ki aayat nazil ki."
"6845","Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) aaey aur zor se mere aik sakht ghoonsaa lagaya aur kaha tu ney aik haar ke liye sab logon ko rok diya. main us se marney ke qareeb ho gaee is qadr mujh ko dard hua lekin kya kar sakti thi kyonke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka sar Mubarak meri raan par tha. ( لكز (aur ( وكز (ke aik hi mana hain."
"6846","Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke agar main apni biwi ke sath kisi ghair mard ko dekh loon to seedhi talwaar ki dhaar se usey mar daalun . ye baat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahunchi to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya tumhen Sad ki ghairat par hairat hai. main unse bhi badh kar ghairat mand hun aur Allah mujh se bhi zyada ghairat mand hai."
"6847","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik dehati aaya aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah! meri biwi ne kala ladka janaa hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne poochha, tumharey paas oont hain? unhon-ne kaha ke ji haan. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha unke rang kaisey hain? unhon-ne kaha ke surkh . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha unmein koi khaakii rang ka bhi hai? unhon-ne kaha ke haan. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha phir ye kahan se aa gaya? unhon-ne kaha mera khayal hai ke kisi rag ne ye rang kheench liya jiski wjah se aisa oont paida hua. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir aisa bhi mumkin hai ke terey betey ka rang bhi kisi rag ne kheench liya ho."
"6848","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah ki hadon mein kisi muqarrara had ke siwa kisi aur saza mein das kode se zyada bataur saza na maarey jaaein. ''"
"6849","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala ki tay ki hui sazaaon mein se se kisi had ke siwa mujrim ko das kode se zyada ki saza na di jaaey.''"
"6850","main Sulaiman-bin-Yasar ke paas betha hua tha ke Abdur-Rehman bin Jaabir aaey aur Sulaiman-bin-Yasar se bayan kya phir Sulaiman-bin-Yasar hamari taraf mutwajjeh huey aur unhon-ne kaha ke mujh se Abdur-Rehman bin Jaabir ne bayan kya hai ke unse unke walid ne bayan kya aur unhon-ne abu-Barda Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) se suna. unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke hudood Allah main se kisi had ke siwa kisi saza mein das kode se zyada ki saza na do."
"6851","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wisaal (musalsal iftaar ke baghair kai din ke rozey rakhney ( se mana farmaya to kuchh sahaba ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aap khud to wisaal kartey hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein se kon mujh jaisa hai? mera to haal ye hai ke mujhey mera rab khilata hai aur pilaataa hai lekin wisaal karne se sahaba nahi rukey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke sath aik din ke baad doosrey din ka wisaal kya phir iske baad logon ne chaand dekh liya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar ( eid ka ( chaand na dikhai deta to main aur wisaal karta. ye aap ne tanbeeh ke taur par farmaya tha kyonke wo wisaal karne par israar kar rahey they. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Shuaib , Yahya-bin-Saeed aur Yunus ne Zohri se ki hai aur Abdur-Rehman bin Khalid Fahmii ne bayan kya, unse ibne-Shahab ne, unse Saeed-bin-Musaiyab ne aur unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kya."
"6852","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane main is par mar padtii ke jab ghalle ke dher yun hi khareedein, bin naapey aur toley usko usi jagah doosrey ke hath bech daalein haan wo ghalla utha kar apne thikaaney ley jayen phir bechein to kuchh saza na hoti."
"6853","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne zaatii maamle mein kabhi kisi se badla nahi liya haan jab Allah ki qaaim ki hui had ko todaa jata to aap phir badla letey they."
"6854","maine 2 liaan karne waley miyan biwi ko dekha tha. us waqt meri umr pandarah saal thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne donon ke darmyan judai kara di thi. shauhar ne kaha tha ke agar ab bhi main (apni biwi ko) apne sath rakhoon to iska matlab ye hai ke main jhoota hun. Sufiyan ne bayan kya ke maine Zohri se ye riwayat mehfooz rakhi hai ke ''agar us aurat ke aisa bachcha paida hua to shauhar sachcha hai aur agar uske aisaa-aisaa bachcha paida hua jaisey chhipkalii hoti hai to shauhar jhoota hai.'' aur maine Zohri se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke us aurat ne us aadmi ke ham-shakl bachcha janaa jo meri tarah ka tha."
"6855","Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne 2 liaan karne walon ka zikr kya to Abdullaah-bin-Shaddaad (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ye wahi thi jiske mutaalliq Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke agar main kisi aurat ko bila gawahi rajm (sangsaar) kar sakta (to usey zaroor kartaa) Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke nahi ye wo aurat thi jo ( fisq w fujoor ( zahir kya karti thi."
"6856","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki majlis mein liaan ka zikr aaya to Aasim bin Adi (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par aik baat kahi phir wo wapas aaey. iske baad unki qaum ke aik sahib ye shikayat lekar unke paas aaey ke unhon-ne apni biwi ke sath ghair mard ko dekha hai. Aasim (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par kaha ke main apni is baat ki wjah se aazmaish mein daala gaya hun. phir aap un sahib ko lekar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki majlis mein tashrif laey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko uski itlaa di jis haalat mein unhon-ne apni biwi ko paya. wo sahib zard rang , kam gosht , seedhey baalon waley they. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey Allah ! us mamla ko zahir kar de. chunanche us aurat ke yahan usi shakhs ki shakl ka bachcha paida hua jiske mutaalliq shauhar ne kaha tha ke usey unhon-ne apni biwi ke sath dekha hai phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne donon ke darmyan liaan karaya. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se majlis mein aik sahib ne kaha ke ye wahi tha jiske mutaalliq Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke agar main kisi ko bila gawahi ke rajm (sangsaar) kar sakta to usey rajm (sangsaar) karta. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke nahi ye to wo aurat thi jo Islam laney ke baad buraaiyaan ea'laaniya karti thi."
"6857","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''saat (7) halaak karney waaley gunahon se bacho . sahaba ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! wo kya kya hain? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ke sath shirk karnaa, jaadoo karnaa, nahaq kisi ki jaan lena jo Allah ne haram kya hai, sood khana , yateem ka maal khana , jang ke din peeth phernaa aur paak daman ghaafil momin aurton ko tohmat lagaanaa .''"
"6858","jisne apne ghulam par tohmat lagai halanke ghulam us tohmat se barii tha to qiyamat ke din usey kode lagaey jaeinge , siwa iske ke uski baat sahi ho."
"6859","aik aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaya aur kaha ke main aapko Allah ki qism deta hun aap hamarey darmyan kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla kar dein. is par fareeq mukhalif khada hua, ye zyada samajhdaar tha aur kaha ke unhon-ne sach kaha, hamara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq kijiye aur ya Rasulullah ! mujhey ( guftgu ki) ijazat dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kahiye. unhon-ne kaha ke mera ladka inke yahan mazdoorii karta tha phir us ne inkii biwi ke sath zina kar liya. maine iske fidya mein aik so bakriyan aur aik khaadim diya phir maine ahale-ilm se puchha to unhon-ne mujhey bataya ke mere betey ko so kode aur aik saal jilaa watanii ki saza milnii chahiye aur iski biwi ko rajm (sangsaar) kya jaeyga Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai, main tumhara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq hi karunga. so bakriyan aur khaadim tumhen wapas milengey aur tumharey betey ko so kode aur aik saal jilaa watanii ki saza di jaeygi aur aey Anees us aurat ke paas subah jana aur us se poochhna agar wo zina ka iqrar kar ley to usey rajm (sangsaar) karnaa, us aurat ne iqrar kar liya aur wo rajm (sangsaar) kar di gaee."
"6860","eik aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaya aur kaha ke main aapko Allah ki qism deta hun aap hamarey darmyan kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla kar dein. is par fareeq mukhalif khada hua, ye zyada samajhdaar tha aur kaha ke unhon-ne sach kaha, hamara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq kijiye aur ya Rasulullah ! mujhey ( guftgu ki) ijazat dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kahiye. unhon-ne kaha ke mera ladka inke yahan mazdoorii karta tha phir us ne inkii biwi ke sath zina kar liya. maine iske fidya mein aik so bakriyan aur aik khaadim diya phir maine ahale-ilm se puchha to unhon-ne mujhey bataya ke mere betey ko so kode aur aik saal jilaa watanii ki saza milnii chahiye aur iski biwi ko rajm (sangsaar) kya jaeyga Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai, main tumhara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq hi karunga. so bakriyan aur khaadim tumhen wapas milengey aur tumharey betey ko so kode aur aik saal jilaa watanii ki saza di jaeygi aur aey Anees us aurat ke paas subah jana aur us se poochhna agar wo zina ka iqrar kar ley to usey rajm (sangsaar) karnaa, us aurat ne iqrar kar liya aur wo rajm (sangsaar) kar di gaii."
"6861","aik sahib yani khud aap ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! Allah ke nazdeek kon sa gunah sabse bada hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ye ke tum Allah ka kisi ko Sharik thehrao jabke us ne tumhen paida kya hai. puchha : phir kon sa ? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir ye ke tum apne ladkey ko us dar se mar dalo ke wo tumharey sath khana khaaeyga. puchha : phir kon sa? farmaya phir ye ke tum apne padosi ki biwi se zina karo. phir Allah Taala ne uski tasdeeq mein ye aayat nazil ki والذين لا يدعون مع الله إلها آخر wla يقتلون النفس التي حرم الله إلا بالحق wla يزنون ومن يفعل ذلك يلق أثاما يضاعف له العذاب''aur wo log jo Allah ke sath kisi doosrey maabood ko nahi pukaartey aur na kisi aisey insan ki nahaq jaan letey hain jisey Allah ne haram kya aur na zina kartey hain aur jo koi aisa karega .'' aakhir aayat tak."
"6862","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''momin us waqt tak apne Deen ke barey mein barabar kushaada rehta hai) usey har waqt maghfirat ki ummeed rehti hai) jab tak nahaq khoon na karey jahan nahaq kya to maghfirat ka darwaza tang ho jata hai.''"
"6863","halaakat ka bhanwar jis mein girney ke baad phir nikalney ki ummeed nahi hai wo nahaq khoon karna hai, jis ko Allah Taala ne haram kya hai."
"6864","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''sabse pahley (qiyamat ke din) logon ke darmyan khoon kharaabey ke faisley kiye jaengey. ''"
"6865","wo badr ki ladai main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Sharik they ke aap ne puchha : ya Rasulullah ! agar jang ke doran meri kisi kaafir se mudbhed ho jaey aur ham aik doosrey ko qatl karne ki koshish karne lagein phir wo mere hath par apni talwaar mar kar usey kaat de aur uske baad kisi darakht ki aad lekar kahey ke main Allah par eman laya to kya main usey uske us iqrar ke baad qatl kar sakta hoon? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey qatl na karna. unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! us ne to mera hath bhi kaat daala aur ye iqrar us waqt kya jab usey yaqin ho gaya ke ab main usey qatl hi kar doonga? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey qatl na karna kyonke agar tum ne usey Islam laney ke baad qatl kar diya to wo tumharey martabe mein hoga jo tumhara usey qatl karne se pahley tha yani ma'soom, aur tum uske martabe mein hogey jo uska us kalima ke iqrar se pahley tha jo usney ab kya hai (yani zaalim)."
"6866","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Miqdad (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya tha ke agar koi musalman kaafiron ke sath rehta ho phir wo dar ke maarey apna eman chhipata ho, agar wo apna eman zahir kar de aur to usko mar daley ye kyon kar durust hoga khud tum bhi to Makka mein pahley apna eman chhipaatey they."
"6867","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo jaan nahaq qatl ki jaey iske ( gunah ka ( aik hissey Adam (Alaihissalam) ke pahley betey (Qaabeel par) padta hai.''"
"7048","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' (qiyamat ke din) mein hauze-kausar par hunga aur apne paas aaney walon ka intizar karta rahunga phir (hauze-kausar) par kuchh logon ko mujh tak pahunchne se pahley hi giraftaar kar liya jaeyga to main kahunga ke ye to meri ummat ke log hain. jawab milega ke aapko malum nahi ye log ultey paon phir gaey they. '' ibne-abi-Mulaika us hadis ko riwayat kartey waqt dua kartey ''aey Allah ! ham teri panah maangtey hain ke ham ultey paon phir jayen ya fitna mein pad jaaein."
"7049","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''hauze-kausar par tum logon ka pesh khema hunga aur tum mein se kuchh log meri taraf aaeingey jab main unhein (hauz ka paanii) dene ke liye jhukoonga to unhein mere samney se kheench liya jaeyga mein kahunga aey mere rab! ye to meri ummat ke log hain. Allah Taala farmaeyga aapko malum nahi ke unhon-ne aap ke baad Deen mein kya kya nai baatein nikal li thiin.''"
"7050","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they ke main hauz kausar par tum se pahley rahunga jo wahan pahunchega to uska pani pieyga aur jo uska pani pi lega wo uske baad kabhi piyaasaa nahi hoga. mere paas aisey log bhi aaeingey jinhein main pehchanta hunga aur wo mujhey pehchantey hongey phir mere aur unke darmyan parda daal diya jaeyga abu-Hazim ne bayan kya ke Nauman bin abi Ayash ne bhi suna ke main unse ye hadis bayan kar raha hun to unhon-ne kaha ke kya tu ney Sehal (Raziallahu anhu) se isi tarah ye hadis suni thi? maine kaha ke haan. unhon-ne kaha ke main gawahi deta hun ke maine Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se ye hadis isi tarah suni thi. abu-Saeed usmein itna badhaatey they ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye log mujh mein se hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se us waqt kaha jaeyga ke aapko malum nahi ke aap ke baad unhon-ne kya tabdeeliyaan kar di thiin? mein kahunga ke doori ho doori ho unke liye jinhoney mere baad Deen mein tabdeeliyaan kar di thin. ''"
"7051","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they ke main hauzey kausar par tum se pahley rahunga jo wahan pahunchega to uska pani pieye ga aur jo iska pani pi lega wo iske baad kabhi piyaasaa nahi hoga. mere paas aisey log bhi aaeingey jinhein main pehchanta hunga aur wo mujhey pehchantey hongey phir mere aur unke darmyan parda daal diya jaeyga abu-Hazim ne bayan kya ke Naumaan-bin-abii-ayaash ne bhi suna ke main unse ye hadis bayan kar raha hun to unhon-ne kaha ke kya tu ney Sehal (Raziallahu anhu) se isi tarah ye hadis suni thi? maine kaha ke haan. unhon-ne kaha ke main gawahi deta hun ke maine Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se ye hadis isi tarah suni thi. abu-Saeed usmein itna badhaatey they ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye log mujh mein se hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se us waqt kaha jaeyga ke aapko malum nahi ke aap ke baad unhon-ne kya badlaaw (تبدیلیاں) kar diye they? main kahunga ke doori ho doori ho unke liye jinhoney mere baad Deen mein badlaaw (تبدیلیاں) kar diye they.''"
"7052","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham se farmaya ''tum mere baad kuchh kaam aisey dekhogey jo tum ko burey lagein gey.'' sahaba ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aap is silsiley mein kya hukm farmatey hain? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''unhein unka haq ada karo aur apna haq Allah se maango.''"
"7053","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo shakhs apne ameer mein koi na-pasand baat dekhey to sabr karey (khaleefa ( ki itaat se agar koi baalisht bhar bhi bahar nikla to uski maut jahiliyat ki maut hogii.''"
"7054","maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne apne ameer ki koi na-pasand cheez dekhi to usey chahey ke sabr karey isliye ke jisne jamat se aik baalisht bhar judai ikhtiyar ki aur usi haal mein maraa to wo jahiliyat ki si maut marey ga.''"
"7056","jin baton ka Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham se ahad liya tha unmein ye bhi tha ke khushi aur naa-gawaarii, tangi aur kushadgi aur apni haq talafi (تلفی) mein bhi itaat aur farmaanbardaarii karein aur ye bhi ke hukmaraanon ke sath hukumat ke barey mein us waqt tak jhagdaa na karein jab tak unko ea'laaniya kufr kartey na dekh lein. agar wo ea'laaniya kufr karein to tum ko Allah ke paas se daleel mil jaeygi."
"7057","aik sahib (khud Usaid) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aap ne falan Amr-bin-al-Aas ko Hakim bana diya aur mujhey nahi banaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum log Ansari mere baad apni haq talafii (تلفی) dekhogey to qiyamat tak sabr karna yahan tak ke tum mujh se aa milo."
"7058","main Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas Madina Munawra mein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki masjid mein betha tha aur hamarey sath Marwan bhi tha. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke maine sabsey sachey insan se suna hai Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri ummat ki tabahi Quraish ke chand ladkon ke hath se hogi. Marwan ne is par kaha un par Allah ki laanat ho. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke agar main unke khandan ke naam lekar batlaanaa chaahoon to batla sakta hun. phir jab bani Marwan Sham (Syria) ki hukumat par qaabiz ho gaey to main apne dada ke sath unki taraf jata tha. jab wahan unhon-ne naujawaan ladkon ko dekha to kaha ke shayad ye unhi mein se hun. ham ne kaha ke aapko zyada ilm hai."
"7059","unhon-ne bayan kya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) neend se bedaar huey to aap ka chehra surkh tha aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe they Allah ke siwa koi maabood nahi. Arbon ki tabahi us balaa se hogi jo qareeb hi aa lagi hai. aaj yaajooj-maajooj ki diwar mein se itna suraakh ho gaya aur Sufiyan ne nawwey ya sou (100) ke adad ke liye ungli baandhii puchha gaya kya ham iske bawajud halaak ho jaeinge ke ham mein saaleheen bhi hongey? farmaya haan ! jab burai badh jaeygi (to aisa hi hoga)."
"7060","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina ke teelon mein se aik teeley par chadhey phir farmaya ke main jo kuchh dekhta hun tum bhi dekhtey ho? logon ne kaha ke nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main fitnon ko dekhta hun ke wo barish ke qatroo (قطروں) ki tarah tumharey gharon mein dakhil ho rahe hain."
"7061","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''zamaana qareeb hota jaeyga aur amal kam hota jaeyga aur laalach dilon mein daal diya jaeyga aur fitney zahir honey lagein gey aur (هرج) ki kasarat ho jaeygi. ''logon ne sawal kya : ya Rasulullah ! ye (هرج) kya cheez hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke qatl ! qatl ! aur Yunus aur Leis aur Zohri ke bhatijey ne bayan kya, unse Zohri ne, unse Humaid ne, unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se."
"7063","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat ke din se pahley aisey din hongey jin mein jahaalat utar padegii aur ilm utha liya jaeyga aur (هرج) badh jaeyga aur (هرج) qatl hai.''"
"7064","Abdullah-bin-Masood aur abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) baithey aur guftgu kartey rahe phir abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat se pahley aisey din aaeingey jin mein ilm utha liya jaeyga aur jahaalat utar padegii aur (هرج) ki kasarat ho jaeygi aur (هرج) qatl hai.''"
"7065","main Abdullah-bin-Masood aur abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath betha hua tha to abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna usi tarah. (هرج) Habsha ki zaban mein qatl ko kehtey hain."
"7066","is hadis ko unhon-ne marfooan (rasoolullaah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se siidhey taur per) bayan kya, kaha ke qiyamat se pahley (هرج) ke din hongey, unmein ilm khatm ho jaeyga aur jahaalat ghalib hogi. abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke habshi zaban main (هرج) ka maanaa qatl hai."
"7067","aap wo hadis jantey hain jo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (هرج) ke dinon wghaira ke mutaalliq bayan ki. ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey suna tha ke wo bad-bakht tareen logon mein se hongey jinki zindagi mein qiyamat aaeygi."
"7068","ham Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaey aur unse Hajjaj ke tarze amal ki shikayat ki, unhon-ne kaha ke sabr karo kyonke tum par jo dour bhi aata hai to iske baad aaney wala dour is se bhi bura hoga yahan tak ke tum apne rab se ja milo. maine ye tumharey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai."
"7069","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke aik raat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghabraaey huey bedaar huey aur farmaya Allah ki zaat paak hai. Allah Taala ne kyaa-kyaa khazaaney nazil kiye hain aur kitney fitney utaarey hain un hujrey waaliyon ko koi bedaar kyon na karey aap ki murad paak beeviyon se thi taake ye Namaz padhein. bahut se duniya mein kapdey baareek pahn-ney waaliyaan aakhirat mein nangii hongii."
"7070","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne ham musalmaanon par hathiyar uthaya wo ham se nahi hai.''"
"7071","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne ham musalmaanon par hathiyar uthaya wo ham se nahi hai.''"
"7072","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''koii shakhs apne kisi deeni bhai ki taraf hathiyar se ishara na karey kyonke wo nahi janta mumkin hai shaitan usey uske hath se chhudwaa de aur phir wo kisi musalman ko mar kar uski wjah se jahannam ke garhey mein gir padey.''"
"7073","maine Amr-bin-Dinar se kaha abu-Muhammad ! tum ne Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se suna hai ke unhon-ne bayan kya ke aik sahib teer lekar masjid mein se guzrey to unse Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke teer ki nouk ka khayal rakho. Amr ne kaha ji haan maine suna hai."
"7074","aik sahib masjid mein teer lekar guzrey jinke phal bahar ko nikley huey they, to unhein hukm diya gaya ke unki nouk ka khayal rakhein ke wo kisi musalman ko zakhmi na kar dein."
"7075","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab tum mein se koi hamari masjid mein ya hamarey bazar mein guzrey aur uske paas teer hon to usey chahiye ke uski nouk ka khayal rakhey.'' ya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke apne hath se unhein thaamey rahe. kahin kisi musalman ko us se koi takleef na pahunchey."
"7076","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' musalman ko gali dena fisq (Allah ki naafarmaani) hai aur usko qatl karna kufr (Allah ka inkaar) hai.''"
"7077","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mere baad kufr ki taraf na lot jana ke aik doosrey ki gardan maarney lago."
"7078","aur aik doosrey shakhs (Humaid-bin-Abdur-Rehmaan ( se bhi suna jo meri nazar mein Abdur-Rehmaan-bin-abii-bakra se achchhey hain aur unse Abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon ko qurbani ke din ko khutba diya aur farmaya ''tumhein malum hai ye kon sa din hai?'' logon ne kaha ke Allah aur uske rasool ko zyada ilm hai. bayan kya ke (iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khamoshi se) ham ye samjhey ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) iska koi aur naam rakhengey. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''kya ye qurbani ka din (yaum النحر) nahi hai?'' ham ne arz kya : kyon nahi, ya Rasulullah ! aap ne phir puchha ''ye kon sa Shahar hai? kya ye al-balda (Makka mukarrma) nahi hai?'' ham ne arz kya : kyon nahi, ya Rasulullah ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''phir tumhara khoon, tumharey maal, tumhari izzat aur tumhari khaal tum par isi tarah hurmat waley hain jis tarah is din ki hurmat is mahiney aur is Shahar mein hai. kya maine pahuncha diya ?'' ham ne kaha ji haan. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aey Allah ! gawah rehna. isliye mera ye paigham maujood log ghair maujood logon ko pahuncha dein kyonke bahut se pahunchaney waley is paigham ko us tak pahunchaaein gey jo isko zyada mehfooz rakhney wala hoga.'' chunanche aisa hi hua aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''mere baad kaafir na ho jana ke kuchh, kuchh ki gardan maarney lago.'' phir jab wo din aaya jab Abdullah Amr-bin Hizrami ko jaariya-bin-qudaama ne aik makan mein gher kar jalaa diya to jaariya ne apne lashkar walon se kaha zara Abu-Bakra ko to jhaanko wo kis khayal mein hai. unhon-ne kaha ye Abu-Bakra maujood hain tum ko dekh rahe hain. Abdur-Rehmaan-bin-abii-bakra kehtey hain mujh se meri walida haala-binte-ghaleez ne kaha ke Abu-Bakra ne kaha agar ye log (jaariya ke lashkar waale) mere ghar mein bhi ghus aaein aur mujh ko maarney lagein to main un par aik baans ki chhadi bhi nahi chalaaunga."
"7079","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''mere baad kaafir na ho jana ke tum mein kuchh, kuchh ki gardan maarney lagey.''"
"7080","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se Hijjatul-wada ke mauqe par farmaya ke logon ko khamosh kar do. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''mere baad kaafir na ho jana ke tum aik doosrey ki gardan maarney lag jaao.''"
"7081","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''an-qareeb aisey fitney barpa hongey jin mein baithney wala khadey hone-waale se behtar hoga aur khada honey wala unmein chalney waley se behtar hoga aur chalney wala unmein daudney waley se behtar hoga, jo door se unki taraf jhank kar bhi dekhega to wo unko bhi samet lengey. us waqt jis kisi ko koi panah ki jagah mil jaey ya bachao ka maqam mil sakey wo usmein chala jaaey.''"
"7082","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aisey fitney barpa hongey ke unmein baithney wala khadey hone-waale se behtar hoga aur khada honey wala chalney waley se behtar hoga aur chalney wala daudney waley se behtar hoga. agar koi unki taraf door se bhi jhank kar dekhega to wo usey bhi samet lengey aisey waqt jo koi us se koi panah ki jagah pa ley usey uski panah ley leni chaahiye.''"
"7083","main aik martaba aapsii fasaadaat ke dinon mein main apne hathiyar laga kar nikla to Abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se rastey mein mulaqat ho gaee. unhon-ne puchha kahan janey ka irada hai? maine kaha ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chacha ke ladkey ki (jange-jamal aur siif'fiin mein) madad karni chahta hun, unhon-ne kaha lot jao. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya hai ke jab do musalman apni talwaaron ko lekar aamney samney muqaabla par aa jayen to donon dozakhi hain. puchha gaya ye to qaatil tha, maqtool ne kya, kiya (ke wo bhi jahannammii ho gayaa)? farmaya ke wo bhi apne muqabil ko qatl karne ka irada kiye huey tha. Hammad-bin-Zaid ne kaha ke phir maine ye hadis Ayub aur yoonus-bin-ubaid se zikr ki, mera maqsad tha ke ye donon bhi mujh se ye hadis bayan karein, un donon ne kaha ke is hadis ki riwayat Hasan Basri ne ahnaf-bin-Qais se aur unhon-ne Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se ki. ham se Sulaimaan-bin-Harb ne bayan kya kaha ham se Hammad-bin-Zaid ne yahi hadis bayan ki aur mua'mmal-bin-Hishaam ne kaha ke ham se Hammad-bin-Zaid ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Ayyoob, Younus, Hisham aur muallaa-bin-Ziyaad ne imam Hasan Basri se bayan kya, unse ahnaf-bin-Qais aur unse Abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aur uski riwayat Mamar ne bhi Ayub se ki hai aur uski riwayat bakkaar-bin-abdul-Azeez ne apne bap se ki aur unse Abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur ghander ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Shoba ne bayan kya, unse Mansoor ne, unse Rabai-bin-Hirash ne, unse Abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se. aur Sufiyan Sory ne bhi is hadis ko mansoor-bin-moa'tamir se riwayat kya, phir ye riwayat marfooaa nahi hai."
"7084","log Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se khair ke barey mein puchha kartey they lekin main shar ke barey mein poochhta tha. is khof se ke kahin meri zindagi mein hi shar na paida ho jaey. maine puchha : ya Rasulullah ! ham jahiliyat aur shar ke daur mein they phir Allah Taala ne hamein is khair se nawaza to kya is khair ke baad phir shar ka zamana hoga? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan. maine puchha : kya us shar ke baad phir khair ka zamana aayega? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya haan lekin us khair mein kamzori hogi. maine puchha ke kamzori kya hogii? farmaya ke kuchh log hongey jo mere tareeqey ke khilaf chalein gey, unki kuchh baatein achi hongi lekin kuchh main tum burai dekhogey. maine puchha kya phir dourey khair ke baad dourey shar aayega? farmaya ke haan, jahannam ki taraf se bulaney waley dozakh ke darwazon par khadey hongey, jo unki baat maan lega wo usmein unhein jhatak dengey. maine kaha : ya Rasulullah ! unki kuchh sifat bayan keejiye. farmaya ke wo hamarey hi jaisey hongey aur hamari hi zaban (arabii) boleyn gey . maine puchha : phir agar maine wo zamana paya to aap mujhey unke barey mein kya hukm detey hain? farmaya ke musalmaanon ki jamat aur unke imam ke sath rehna. maine kaha ke agar muslamaanon ki jamat na ho aur na unka koi imam ho? farmaya ke phir un tamam logon se alag ho kar chahe tumhen jangal mein ja kar darakhton ki jadein chabaani (چبانی) parrey yahan tak ke usi haalat mein tumhari maut aa jaey."
"7085","ahale-Madeena ka aik lashkar taiyaar kya gaya (yani Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ke zamane mein Sham (Syria) walon se muqaabla karne ke liye) aur mera naam usmein likh diya gaya. phir main Ikrima se mila aur maine unhein khabar di to unhon-ne mujhey shirkat se sakhti ke sath mana kya. phir kaha ke Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujhey khabar di hai ke kuchh musalman jo mushrekeen ke sath rahtey they wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke khilaf (jangoon) mein mushrekeen ki jamat ki zyadti ka baais bantey . phir koi teer aata aur unmein se kisi ko lag jata aur qatl kar deta ya unhein koi talwaar se qatl kar detaa, phir Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil ki (إن الذين توفاهم الملائكة ظالمي أنفسهم‏) '' bila shak wo log jinko Farishtey faut kartey hain us haal mein ke wo apni jaanon par zulm karne waley hotey hain.''"
"7086","ham se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne 2 hadison farmai thin jin mein se aik to maine dekh li dusri ka intizar hai. ham se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke amanat logon ke dilon ki jadoon mein nazil hui thi phir logon ne usey Quran se seekhaa, phir sunnat se seekha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham se amanat ke uth janey ke mutaalliq farmaya tha ke aik shakhs aik neend soeyga aur amanat uske dil se nikal di jaeygi aur iska nishan aik dhabbey jitna baqi reh jaeyga phir wo aik neend soeyga aur phir amanat nikaalii jaeygi to iske dil mein aabley ki tarah iska nishan baqi reh jaeyga, jaisey tum ne koi chingaarii apne paon par gira li ho aur uski wjah se aabla pad jaey, tum usmein soojan dekhogey lekin andar kuchh nahi hoga aur log khareed w farokht karengey lekin koi amanat ada karne wala nahi hoga. phir kaha jaeyga ke falan qabeeley mein aik amanat daar aadmi hai aur kisi ke mutaalliq kaha jaeyga ke wo kis qadr aqlmand, kitna khush tabiat ka, kitna dilaawar aadmi hai halanke uske dil mein raai ke daney ke barabar bhi eman na hoga aur mujh par aik zamana guzar gaya aur main uski parwaa nahi karta tha ke tum mein se kis ke sath mein lein-dein karta hun agar wo musalman hota to uska Islam usey mere haq ke ada karne par majbur karta aur agar wo nasrani hota to iske Hakim log usko dabaatey emaandari par majbur kartey. lekin aaj kal to main sirf falan-falan logon se hi lein-dein karta hun."
"7087","wo Hajjaj ke yahan gaey to usne kaha ke aey ibne- Akwa' ! tum gaaun mein rehney lagey ho kya ultey paon phir gaey? kaha ke nahi balke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey jangal mein rehney ki ijazat di thi aur Yazeed bin abi Ubaid se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha ke jab Usman-bin-Affan (Raziallahu anhu) Shahid kiye gaey to Salma bin Akwa' (Raziallahu anhu) Rabza chaley gaey aur wahan aik aurat se shadi kar li aur wahan unke bachchey bhi paida huey. wo barabar wahin par rahe, yahan tak ke wafat se chand din pahley Madina aagey they."
"7088","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''wo waqt qareeb hai ke musalman ka behtreen maal wo bakriyan hongi jinhein wo lekar pahaadii ki chotiyon aur barish barasney ki jaghon par chala jaeyga wo fitnon se apne Deen ki hifazat ke liye wahan bhag kar aa jaaeyga.''"
"7089","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon se sawalat kiye. aakhir jab log baar-baar sawal karne lagey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) member par aik din chadhey aur farmaya ke aaj tum mujh se jo sawal bhi karogey main tumhen iska jawab doonga . Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir main daaein-baaein dekhney laga to har shakhs ka sar uske kapdey mein chipa hua tha aur wo ro raha tha. aakhir aik shakhs ne khamoshi todii. uska jab kisi se jhagdaa hota to unhein unke bap ke siwa doosrey bap ki taraf pukara jata. unhon-ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! mere walid kon hain? farmaya tumharey walid Huzafa hain. phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) samney aaey aur arz kya ham Allah se ke wo rab hai, Islam se ke wo Deen hai, Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ke wo rasool hain razi hain aur aazmaish ki burai se ham Allah ki panah maangtey hain. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine khair w shar aaj jaisa dekha, kabhi nahi dekha tha. mere samney jannat w dozakh ki sura pesh ki gaee aur maine unhein diwar ke qareeb dekha. Qatada ne bayan kya ke ye baat is aayat ke sath zikr ki jati hai يا أيها الذين آمنوا لا تسألوا an (an) أشياء إن تبد لكم تسؤكم‏ ke ''aey logo ! jo eman laey ho aisi chizon ke barey mein sawal na karo agar wo zahir kar di jayen to tumhen buri malum hoon.''"
"7090","aur Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha har shakhs kapdey mein apna sar lapetey huey ro raha tha aur fitney se Allah ki panah maang raha tha ya yun keh raha tha ke main Allah se fitne ki burai se panah mangta hun."
"7091","phir yahi hadis Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se naql ki, usmein bajaey (soo) ke (shar) ka lafz hai."
"7092","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) member ke aik taraf khadey huey aur farmaya ''fitna idhar hai, fitna idhar hai jidhar se shaitan ka seeng tuloo hota hai ya suraj ka seeng farmaya''"
"7093","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mashriq ki taraf rukh kiye huey they aur farma rahe they '' aagah ho jao, fitna us taraf hai jidhar se shaitan ka seeng tuloo hota hai.''"
"7094","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aey Allaah! hamarey mulk Sham (Syria) mein hamein barkat de, hamarey Yaman mein hamein barkat de.'' sahaba ne arz kya aur hamarey Najad mein? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir farmaya ''aey Allah hamarey Sham (Syria) mein barkat de, hamein hamarey Yaman mein barkat de.'' sahaba ne kaha aur hamarey Najad mein? mera guman hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne teesri martaba farmaya '' wahan zalzaley aur fitney hain aur wahan shaitan ka seeng tuloo hoga.''"
"7095","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) hamarey paas aaey to ham ne ummeed ki ke wo ham se koi achi baat karengey. itney mein aik sahib hakeem naam ke ham se pahley unke paas pahunch gaey aur puchha : aey abu-Abdur-Rehmaan! ham se zamana fitne mein qitaal ke mutaalliq hadis bayan keejiye. Allah Taala farmata hai tum unse jang karo yahan tak ke fitna baqi na rahe. ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha tumhen malum bhi hai ke fitna kya hai? tumhari maan tumhen roey Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) fitna rafa' karne ke liye mushrekeen se jang kartey they, shirk mein padnaa ye fitna hai. kya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ladai tum logon ki tarah badhshahat hasil karne ke liye hoti thi?"
"7096","ham umr (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein baithey huey they ke unhon-ne puchha : tum mein se kisey fitne ke barey mein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka farman yad hai? Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke insan ka fitna (aazmaaish) uski beewii, uske maal, uske bachchey aur padosi ke maamlaat mein hota hai jiska kaffara namaaz, sadqa, bhalai ka hukm aur burai se rokna kar deta hai. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main iske mutaalliq nahi poochhta balke us fitne ke barey mein poochhta hun jo dariya ki tarah thaathein maarega. Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke ameerul-momineen aap par iska koi khatrah nahi iske aur aap ke darmyan aik band darwaza rukawat hai. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne puchha kya wo darwaza tod diya jaeyga ya khola jaaeyga? bayan kya tod diya jaeyga umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par kaha ke phir to wo kabhi band na ho sakega. maine kaha ji haan. ham ne Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha : kya umr (Raziallahu anhu) us darwaze ke mutaalliq jantey they? farmaya ke haan, jis tarah main janta hun ke kal se pahley raat aaeygii kyonke maine aisi baat bayan ki thi jo be-buniyaad nahi thi. hamein unse ye poochhtey huey dar laga ke wo darwaza kon they. chunanche ham ne Masruq se kaha (ke wo poochhein) jab unhon-ne puchha ke wo darwaza kon they? to unhon-ne kaha ke wo darwaza umr (Raziallahu anhu) they."
"7097","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina ke baghaat mein kisi baagh ki taraf apni kisi zarurat ke liye gaey, main bhi aap ke peechhey-peechhey gaya. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baagh mein dakhil huey to main iske darwazey par baith gaya aur apne dil mein kaha ke aaj main aap ka darbaan banoonga halanke aap ne mujhey iska hukm nahi diya tha. aap andar chaley gaey aur apni haajat poori ki. phir aap kunwein ki munder par baith gaey aur apni donon pindliyon ko khol kar unhein kunwein mein latkaa liya. phir Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) aaey aur andar janey ki ijazat chahi . maine unse kaha ke aap yahin rahein, main aap ke liye ijazat lekar aata hun. chunanche wo khadey rahe aur maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar arz kya : ya Nabi Allaah! Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) aap ke paas aaney ki ijazat chahtey hain. farmaya ke unhein ijazat de do aur unhein jannat ki bashaarat suna do. chunanche wo andar aagey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki daain taraf aa kar unhon-ne bhi apni pindliyon ko khol kar kunein mein latkaa liya. itney mein umr (Raziallahu anhu) aaey. maine kaha thehro main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat ley loon (aur maine andar ja kar aap se arz kya) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya unko bhi ijazat de aur jannat ki khushkhabri bhii. khair wo bhi aaey aur usi kunwein ki mundeer par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baain taraf baithey aur apni pindliyaan khol kar kunein mein latkaa din. aur kunwein ki mundeer bhar gaee aur wahan jagah na rahi. phir Usman (Raziallahu anhu) aaey aur maine unse bhi kaha ke yahin rahiye yahan tak ke aap ke liye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat maang loon. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unhein ijazat do aur jannat ki bashaarat de do aur uske sath aik aazmaish hai jo unhein pahunchegii. phir wo bhi dakhil huey, unke sath baithney ke liye koi jagah na thi. chunanche wo ghoom kar unke samney kunein ke kinarey par aagey phir unhon-ne apni pindliyaan khol kar kunwein mein paon latkaa liye, phir mere dil mein bhai (ghaaliban abu-Barda ya abu-Raham) ki tamanna paida hui aur main dua karne laga ke wo bhi aa jatey, ibne-Musaiyab ne bayan kya ke maine us se unki qabron ki tabeer li ke sab ki qabrein aik jagah hongi lekin Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ki alag Baqee gharqad mein hai."
"7098","Usama (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha gaya ke aap (Usman bin Affaan (Raziallahu anhu)) se guftgu kyon nahi kartey (ke aam musalmanon ki shikaayaton ka khayal rakhein ( unhon-ne kaha ke maine (khilwat mein) unse guftgu ki hai lekin (fitne ke) darwaze ko kholey baghair ke is tarah main sabse pahley us darwaza ko kholney wala hunga main aisa aadmi nahi hun ke kisi shakhs se jab wo 2 aadmiyon par ameer bana diya jaey ye kahun ke to sabse behtar hai. jabke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sun chuka hun. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aik shakhs ko (qiyamat ke din) laya jaeyga aur usey aag mein daal diya jaeyga phir wo usmein is tarah chakkii peesega jaisey gadhaa peestaa hai. phir dozakh ke log iske charon taraf jama ho jaeinge aur kahengey, aey fulaan! kya tum nekiyon ka hukm kartey aur buraaiyon se rokaa nahi kartey they? wo shakhs kahega ke main achi baat ke liye kehta to zaroor tha lekin khud nahi karta tha aur buri baat se roktaa bhi tha lekin khud karta tha."
"7099","jange-jamal ke zamane mein mujhey aik kalime ne fayda pahunchaya jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko malum hua ke Faaris ki saltanat walon ne boraan naam ke Kisraa ki beti ko badshah bana liya hai to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo qaum kabhi falaah nahi paaeygii jiski hukumat aik aurat ke hath mein ho."
"7100","ham se Abdullah-bin Muhammad ne bayan kya, unhon-ne kaha ham se Yahyaa-bin-Aadam ne bayan kya, unhon-ne kaha ham se abu-Bakar-bin-Ayaash ne bayan kya, unhon-ne kaha ham se abu-Haseen ne bayan kya, unhon-ne kaha ham se abu-Maryam Abdullah-bin Ziyad al-Asadii ne bayan kya ke jab Tal'ha, Zuber aur Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) Basra ki taraf rawaana huey to Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne Ammaar-bin-Yaasir aur Hasan-bin-Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ko bhejaa. ye donon buzurg hamarey paas Kufa aaey aur member par chadhey. Hasan-bin-Ali (Raziallahu anhu) member ke uper sabse unchi jagah they aur Ammaar-bin-Yaasir (Raziallahu anhu) unse nichey they. phir ham unke paas jama ho gaey aur maine Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey suna ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) Basra gaee hain aur Allah ki qism wo duniya aur aakhirat main tumharey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak biwi hain lekin Allah tabarak w taala ne tumhen aazmaya hai taake jaan ley ke tum us Allah ki itaat kartey ho ya Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki."
"7101","Kufa mein Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) member par khadey huey aur Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) aur unki rawaangii ka zikr kya aur kaha ke bila shubah wo duniya aur aakhirat main tumharey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki bevi hain lekin tum unke barey mein aazmaey gaey ho."
"7104","abu-Moosa aur Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) donon Ammar bin-Yaasir (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaey jab unhein Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne ahale-koofa ke paas isliye bheja tha ke logon ko ladney ke liye taiyaar karein. abu-Musa aur Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) donon Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) se kehney lagey jab se tum muslmaan huey ho ham ne koi baat us se zyada buri nahi dekhi jo tum is kaam mein jaldi kar rahe ho. Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) ne jawab diya maine bhi jab se tum donon musalman huey ho tumhari koi baat is se buri nahi dekhi jo tum us kaam mein der kar rahe ho. Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) aur abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) donon ko eik-eik kapdey ka nayaa joda pahnaayaa phir teenon mil kar masjid mein tashrif ley gaey."
"7107","main abu-Masood, abu-Musa aur Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath betha hua tha. Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha hamarey sath waley jitney log hain main agar chaahoon to tumharey siwa unmein se har aik ka kuchh na kuchh aib bayan kar sakta hun. (lekin tum aik be-aeib ho) aur jab se tum ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sohbat ikhtiyar ki, maine koi aib ka kaam tumhara nahi dekha. aik yahi aib ka kaam dekhta hun, tum us daur mein yani logon ko jang ke liye uthaney mein jaldi kar rahe ho. Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) tum se aur tumharey sathi abu-Musa Ash-ari se jab se tum donon ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sohbat ikhtiyar ki hai maine koi aib ka kaam us se zyada nahi dekha jo tum donon us kaam mein der kar rahe ho. is par Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha aur wo maaldaar aadmi they ke ghulam ! 2 hulley laao. chunanche unhon-ne aik hulla abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ko diya aur doosra Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) ko aur kaha ke aap donon bhai kapdey pahan kar Juma padhney chalein ."
"7108","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab Allah kisi qaum par azab nazil karta hai to azab un sab logon par aata hai jo us qaum mein hotey hain phir unhein unke aamaal ke mutabiq uthaya jaaeyga.''"
"7109","aur meri unse mulaqat Kufa mein hui thi. wo ibne-shabarma ke paas aaey aur kaha ke mujhey Esa (Mansoor ke bhai aur Kufa ke waali) ke paas ley chalo taake main usey nasihat karun. ghaaliban ibne- shabarma ne khof mehsus kya aur nahi ley gaey. unhon-ne is par bayan kya ke ham se Hasan Basri ne bayan kya ke jab Hasan-bin-Ali ameer Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ke khilaf lashkar lekar nikley to Amr-bin-al-Aas ne ameer Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha ke main aisa lashkar dekhta hun jo us waqt tak wapas nahi ja sakta jab tak apne muqabil ko bhagaa na ley. phir ameer Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke musalmanon ke ahal w ayaal ka kon kafeel hoga? jawab diya ke main, phir Abdullah-bin Aamir aur Abdur-Rehman bin Samra ne kaha ke ham Ameer-Muaawiya (Raziallahu anhu) se miltey hain (aur unse suleh ke liye kehtey hain) Hasan Basri ne kaha ke maine Abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khutba de rahe they ke Hasan (Raziallahu anhu) aaey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mera ye betaa saiyed hai aur ummeed hai ke iske zariey Allah musalmanon ki 2 jamaton mein suleh kara dega."
"7110","maine Hurmala ko dekha tha Hurmala ne bayan kya ke mujhey Usama ne Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas bheja aur mujh se kaha, us waqt tum se Ali (Raziallahu anhu) poochhengey ke tumharey sathi (Usaama (Raziallahu anhu)) jange-jamal w safein se kyon peechhey reh gaey they, to unse kehna ke unhon-ne aap se kaha hai ke agar aap sher ke munh mein hon tab bhi mein usmein bhi aap ke sath rahoon lekin ye mamla hi aisa hai yani musalmanon ki aapas ki jang to (is mein shirkat saheeh) nahi malum hui (hurmala kehtey hain ke) chunanche unhon-ne koi cheez nahi di. phir main Hasan, Husain aur Abdullah-bin Jafar (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaya to unhon-ne meri sawari par itna maal ladwaa diya jitna ke oont utha na sakta tha."
"7111","jab ahale-Madeena ne Yazeed bin Muawiya ki bait se inkar kya to Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne apne khaadimon aur ladkon ko jama kya aur kaha ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke har ghadr karne waley ke liye qiyamat ke din aik jhanda khada kya jaeyga aur ham ne us shakhs ( Yazeed ( ki bait , Allah aur uske rasool ke naam par ki hai aur mere ilm mein koi ghadr us se badh kar nahi hai ke kisi shakhs se Allah aur uske rasool ke naam par bait ki jaey aur phir us se jang ki jaey aur dekho Madina waalo! tum mein se jo koi Yazeed ki bait ko todey aur doosrey kisi se bait karey to mujh main aur is mein koi talluq nahi raha, mein us se alag hun."
"7112","jab Abdullah-bin Ziyad aur Marwan Sham (Syria) mein they aur ibne-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ne Makka mein aur khawaarij ne Basra mein qabza kar liya tha to main apne walid ke sath abu-Barza Aslami (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaya. jab ham unke ghar mein aik kamre ke saaye mein baithey huey they jo baans ka bana hua tha, ham unke paas baith gaey aur mere walid unse baat karne lagey aur kaha : aey abu-Barza! aap nahi dekhtey log kin baton mein aafat aur ikhtilaf mein ulajh gaey hain. maine unki zaban se sabse pehli baat ye suni ke main jo in Quraish ke logon se naraz hun to mahz Allah ki raza mandi ke liye, Allah mera ajr dene wala hai. Arab ke logo! tum jantey ho pahley tumhara kya haal tha tum gumrahi mein giraftaar they, Allah ne Islam ke zariey aur Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zariey tum ko is buri haalat se nijat di. yahan tak ke tum is rutbe ko pahunchey. (duniyaa ke Hakim aur sardaar bin gaey) phir usi duniya ne tum ko kharaab kar diya. dekho! ye shakhs jo Sham (Syria) mein Hakim bin betha hai yani Marwan duniya ke liye lad raha hai. ye log jo tumharey samney hain. ( khawaarij ( Allah ki qism ! ye log sirf duniya ke liye lad rahe hain aur wo jo Makka mein hai Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) , Allah ki qism ! wo bhi sirf duniya ke liye lad raha hai."
"7113","aaj kal ke munafiq Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney ke munaafeqeen se badtar hain. us waqt chhipaatey they aur aaj iska khullam khullaa izhar kar rahe hain."
"7114","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein nifaq tha aaj to eman ke baad kufr ikhtiyar karna hai."
"7115","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat qaaim na hogi yahan tak ke aik shakhs doosrey ki qabr ke paas se guzrega aur kahega, kash! main usi ki jagah hota. ''"
"7116","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke qiyamat qaaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke qabila dos ki aurton ka zul-khalasa ka ( tawaaf kartey huey) koolhey se koolhey chhilley aur zul-khalasa qabila dos ka but tha jis ko wo zamana jahiliyat mein puja kartey they."
"7117","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat us waqt tak qaaim na hogi yahan tak ke qahtaan ka aik shakhs ( badshah bin kar) niklega aur logon ko apne dandey se haankega.''"
"7118","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat qaaim na hogi yahan tak ke sar zameene-hijaaz se aik aag niklegii aur Basra mein oonton ki gardanon ko roshan kar degi. ''"
"7119","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''an-qareeb dariyaaey Furaat se soney ka aik khazaana niklega to jo koi wahan maujood ho wo usmein se kuchh na ley.''"
"7120","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' sadqa karo kyonke an-qareeb logon par aik aisa zamana aayega jab aik shakhs apna sadqa lekar phirega aur koi usey leney wala nahi milega.'' Musaddad ne bayan kya ke Harisa Ubaidullah-bin-Umar ke maan-shareek bhai they."
"7121","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat us waqt tak qaaim na hogi jab tak 2 azeem jamatein jang na karengii. un donon jamaton ke darmyan badi khoonrezii hogi. halanke donon ka dawa aik hi hoga aur yahan tak ke bahut se jhootey dajjal bhejey jaengey. taqriban tees dajjaal. unmein se har aik dawa karega ke wo Allah ka rasool hai aur yahan tak ke ilm utha liya jaeyga aur zalzalon ki kasarat hogi aur zamana qareeb ho jaeyga aur fitney zahir ho jaeinge aur haraj badh jaeyga aur haraj se murad qatl hai aur yahan tak ke tumharey paas maal ki kasarat ho jaeygi balke bah padega aur yahan tak ke saahibe-maal ko uska fikr daamangeer hoga ke iska sadqa qabool kon karey aur yahan tak ke wo pesh karega lekin jiske samney pesh karega wo kahega ke mujhey uski zarurat nahi hai aur yahan tak ke log badi badii imaaraton par aapas mein fakhr karengey. aik se aik badh chadh kar Imaarat banaaeingey aur yahan tak ke aik shakhs doosrey ki qabr se guzrega aur kahega ke kash! main bhi usi jagah hota aur yahan tak ke suraj maghrib se niklega. to jab wo is tarah tuloo hoga aur log dekh lengey to sab eman ley aaeingey lekin ye wo waqt hoga jab kisi aisey shakhs ko uska eman lana fayda na pahunchaaeyga jo pahley se eman na laya ho ya us ne apne eman ke sath achchhey kaam na kiye hun aur qiyamat achcha is tarah qaaim ho jaeygi ke 2 aadmiyon ne apne darmyan kapda phaila rakha hoga aur usey abhi bech na paaey hongey na lapet paaey hongey aur qiyamat is tarah barpa ho jaeygi ke aik shakhs apni ontni ka doodh nikal kar wapas hua hoga ke usey kha bhi na paya hoga aur qiyamat is tarah qaaim ho jaeygi ke wo apne hauz ko durust kar raha hoga aur is mein se pani bhi na piyaa hoga aur qiyamat is tarah qaaim ho jaeygi ke usne apna luqma munh ki taraf uthaya hoga aur abhi usey khaya bhi na hoga."
"7122","dajjal ke barey mein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se jitna maine puchha utnaa kisi ne nahi puchha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya tha ke us se tumhen kya nuqsan pahunchega. maine arz kya ke log kehtey hain ke iske sath roti ka pahaad aur pani ki nehar hogi, farmaya ke wo Allah par us se bhi zyada aasan hai."
"7123","ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''dajjaal dahini aankh se kaana hoga uski aankh kya hai maano phoolaa hua angoor.''"
"7124","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''dajjaal aayega aur Madina ke aik kinarey qiyam karega, phir Madina teen martaba kaanpega aur uske nateejey mein har kaafir aur munafiq nikal kar uski taraf chala jaaeyga.''"
"7125","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Madeena walon par dajjal ka raub nahi padega us din Madina ke saat (7) darwazey hongey har darwazey par 2 Farishtey ( pahra detey ( hongey. ''"
"7126","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' Madina par Masih dajjal ka raub nahi padega . us waqt uske saat (7) darwazey hongey aur har darwazey par pahredaar 2 Farishtey hongey. '' Ali-bin-Abdullaah ne kaha ke Muhammad-bin Ishaq ne Saleh bin Ibrahim se riwayat kya, unse unke walid Ibrahim bin Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf ne bayan kya ke main Basra gaya to mujh se Abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) ne yahi hadis bayan ki."
"7127","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon mein khadey huey aur Allah ki tareef uski shaan ke mutabiq bayan ki. phir dajjal ka zikr farmaya ke main tumhen us se daraataa hun aur koi Nabi aisa nahi guzra jisne apni qaum ko us se na daraayaa ho, albatta main tumhen iske barey mein aik baat bataataa hun jo kisi Nabi ne apni qaum ko nahi batai thi aur wo ye ke wo kaana hoga aur Allah Taala kaana nahi hai."
"7128","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''main soyaa hua ( khuwab mein) Kaba ka tawaaf kar raha tha ke aik sahib jo gehunwey rang ke they aur unke sar ke baal seedhey they aur sar se pani tapak raha tha (un par meri nazar padi ( maine puchha ye kon hain? mere sath ke logon ne bataya ke ye Esa ibne-Maryam (Alaihissalam) hain phir maine mud kar dekha to motey shakhs par nazar padi jo surkh tha uske baal ghunghraaley they, aik aankh ka kaana tha, uski aik aankh angoor ki tarah uthi hui thi. logon ne bataya ke ye dajjal hai. uski sura abdul-Uzzaa bin qatan se bahut miltii thi."
"7129","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap apni Namaz mein dajjal ke fitney se panah maangtey they."
"7130","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dajjal ke barey mein farmaya ke iske sath pani aur aag hogi aur uski aag thanda pani hogi aur pani aag hoga. Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine bhi ye hadis Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suni hai."
"7131","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo Nabi bhi maboos kya gaya to unhon-ne apni qaum ko kaaney jhootey se daraayaa , aagah raho ke wo kaana hai aur tumhara rab kaana nahi hai. aur uski donon aankhon ke darmyan '' kaafir '' likha hua hai.'' is baab mein Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) aur Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye hadis riwayat ki hai."
"7132","aik din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham se dajjal ke mutaalliq aik lambi hadis bayan ki. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke irshadat mein ye bhi tha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' dajjal aayega aur uske liye naa-mumkin hoga ke Madina ki ghatiyon mein dakhil ho. chunanche wo Madina Munawra ke qareeb kisi shor wali zameen par qiyam karega. phir us din uske paas aik mard momin jaeyga aur wo afzal tareen logon mein se hoga aur us se kahega ke main gawahi deta hun is baat ki jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham se bayan farmaya tha. is par dajjal kahega kya tum dekhtey ho agar main usey qatl kar dun aur phir zinda karun to kya tumhen mere maamle mein shak w shuba baqi rahega? uske paas waley log kahengey ke nahi, chunanche wo us sahib ko qatl kar dega aur phir usey zinda kar dega. ab wo sahib kahengey ke Allah ki qasam! aaj se zyada mujhey terey mamley mein pahley itni baseerat hasil na thi. is par dajjal phir unhein qatl karna chaahega lekin is martaba usey mar na sakega.''"
"7133","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' Madina Munawra ke raston par Farishtey pahra detey hain na yahan taaoon aa sakti hai aur na dajjal aa sakta hai.''"
"7134","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''dajjaal Madina tak aayega to yahan farishton ko uski hifazat kartey huey paaeyga chunanche na dajjal uske qareeb aa sakta hai aur na taaoon, inshaAllah .''"
"7135","aik din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke paas ghabraaey huey dakhil huey, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe they ke tabahi hai Arbon ke liye us burai se jo qareeb aa chuki hai. aaj yaajooj maajooj ki diwar se itna khul gaya hai aur aap ne apne angoothey aur uski qareeb wali ungli ko mila kar aik halqa banaya. itna sun kar Zenab bin Jahash (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! to kya ham iske bawajud halaak ho jaeinge ke ham mein nek Saleh log bhi zinda hongey ? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, jab burai bahut badh jaeygi."
"7136","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' ( سد ( yani yaajooj maajooj ki diwar itni khul gaee hai.'' Wuhaib ne nawwey ka ishara karke batlaya ."